WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[201614] = "Learn to craft the following item:\nReaves Module: Piloted Combat Mode"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[201615] = "Learn to craft the following item:\nBlingtron's Circuit Design Tutorial"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[201628] = "Throws two demonic glaives in a whirlwind of energy, causing 0 Chaos damage over 3 sec to all nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[201664] = "Demoralizes all enemies within 10 yards, reducing the damage they do by 20% for 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[201789] = "Throws two demonic glaives in a whirlwind of energy, causing 0 Chaos damage over 3 sec to all nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[201845] = "Stormstrike has a 5.0% chance to reset the cooldown of Stormstrike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[201900] = "Melee auto-attacks with Flametongue Weapon active have a 5% chance to reduce the cooldown of Lava Lash by 25% and increase the damage of Lava Lash by 20% for 8 sec.\n\nMay not occur during an active Hot Hand."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202021] = "Tiger's Fury lasts 5 additional seconds.\n\nYour combo point-generating abilities' direct damage is increased by 40% of your Haste."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202028] = "Strikes all nearby enemies with a massive slash, inflicting 66 Physical damage. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets.\n\nAwards 1 combo point."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202031] = "Ferocious Bite deals 15% increased damage.\n\nFor each Combo Point spent, Ferocious Bite's primary target takes 6% increased damage from your Cat Form bleed and other periodic abilities for 4 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202095] = "Your maximum health is increased by 10% and every 15 Rage you spend heals you for 1% of your maximum health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202107] = "Reduces the cooldown of Fortifying Brew by 50%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202137] = "Place a Sigil of Silence at the target location that activates after 2 sec.\n\nSilences all enemies affected by the sigil for 2 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202138] = "Place a Sigil of Chains at the target location that activates after 2 sec.\n\nAll enemies affected by the sigil are pulled to its center and are snared, reducing movement speed by 70% for 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202162] = "Guard the 4 closest players within 15 yards for 15 sec, allowing you to Stagger 20% of damage they take."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202163] = "Reduces the cooldown of Heroic Leap by 15 sec and Heroic Leap also increases your movement speed by 70% for 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202168] = "Instantly attack the target, causing 20 damage and healing you for 30% of your maximum health.\n\nKilling an enemy that yields experience or honor resets the cooldown of Impending Victory and makes it cost no Rage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202226] = "Entangling Roots is now an instant cast spell with a 6 second cooldown but with a 10 yard range. It can also be cast while in shapeshift forms."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202246] = "Charge to an enemy, stunning them for 3 sec and knocking back their allies within 15 yards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202316] = "If Cleave or Whirlwind hits 3 or more targets you also Slam your primary target. This Slam deals 50% additional damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202335] = "Your next Keg Smash deals 50% additional damage, and stuns all targets it hits for 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202342] = "Moonfire and Sunfire damage over time has a chance to call down a falling star, dealing 254 Astral damage and generating 2 Astral Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202345] = "Starsurge and Starfall grant you 2% Haste for 20 sec or until you enter a new Eclipse.\n\nStacks up to 3 times. Gaining a stack does not refresh the duration."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202347] = "Burns the target for 136 Astral damage, and then an additional 894 damage over 24 sec. If dispelled, causes 803 damage to the dispeller and blasts them upwards.\n\nGenerates 12 Astral Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202370] = "You perform a Mighty Ox Kick, hurling your enemy a distance behind you."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202424] = "Reduces the cooldown of Life Cocoon by 45 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202425] = "Your next 3 Starfires are instant cast and generate 30% increased Astral Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202430] = "While in combat you generate 1 Astral Power every 2 sec.\n\nWhile out of combat your Astral Power rebalances to 50 instead of depleting to empty."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202538] = "Most think to this day that the infamous leader of the Defias Brotherhood died in the Deadmines years ago thanks to an elixir that mimiced death and flame retardant armor. In truth, the wayward daughter of Westfall found her way into the secretive order of the Uncrowned, where her anti-government motives were well at home. She quickly rose through the ranks to the mysterious Shadows, poised to finally have the means to enact her revenge."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202560] = "Your dodges, parries, and auto-attacks make your Revenge cost no Rage 20% more frequently and increase the damage your free Revenges deal by 15%. \n\nRevenge increases the damage of your next Thunder Clap by 8%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202577] = "Enveloping Mist transforms 80% of its remaining periodic healing into a Dome of Mist when dispelled.\n\n Dome of Mist\nAbsorbs damage. All healing received by the Monk increased by 30%. Lasts 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202603] = "You gain 2% Haste for each enemy or ally within 10 yards, up to 8% Haste."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202626] = "While in Cat Form, you increase the movement speed of raid members within 20 yards by 10%.\n\nLeader of the Pack also causes allies to heal themselves for 3% of their maximum health when they critically hit with a direct attack. The healing effect cannot occur more than once every 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202719] = "Remove 1 beneficial effect from all enemies within 8 yards and generate 15 Fury."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202727] = "Your Death and Decay rots enemies each time it deals damage, absorbing healing equal to 100% of damage dealt."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202737] = "Increases Astral Power generated by Solar Wrath and Lunar Strike by 25%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202739] = "Grants 2 Astral Power every 2.7 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202743] = "Demoralizing Shout also generates 20 Rage and increases damage you deal to affected targets by 20%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202746] = "Feign Death reduces damage taken by 90% for 2 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202770] = "Calls down a beam of pure celestial energy that follows the enemy, dealing up to 1,114 Astral damage over 8 sec within its area. Damage reduced on secondary targets.\n\nGenerates 40 Astral Power over its duration."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202918] = "Reduces the remaining cooldown on Solar Beam by 15 sec when it interrupts the primary target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[202996] = "Starsurge has a chance to summon the Spirit of Goldrinn, which immediately deals 395 Arcane damage to the target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203173] = "Chains 3 enemies together, dealing 10.3 Shadow damage and causing 20% of all damage taken to also be received by the others in the chain. Lasts for 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203177] = "Shield Slam generates 2 more Rage and extends the duration of Shield Block by 1.0 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203201] = "Thunder Clap's radius is increased by 50% and it reduces affected target's movement speed by an additional 20%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203224] = "Rake has a 100% increased critical strike chance if used on a target that doesn’t already have Rake active."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203235] = "Aspect of the Cheetah has 50% reduced cooldown and grants its effects to allies within 30 yds."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203242] = "Infected Wounds can now stack up to 2 times, and reduces 8% of all healing received by the target per stack.\n\nInfected Wounds can now also be applied from Rip."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203275] = "If you have not cast Fireball for 8 sec, your next Fireball will deal 70% increased damage with a 40% reduced cast time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203280] = "Empower Flamestrike, dealing up to 50% more damage based on enemies' distance to the center of Flamestrike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203286] = "Hurls an immense fiery boulder that deals up to 30% of the target's total health in Fire damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203340] = "Victims of Freezing Trap can no longer be damaged or healed.  Freezing Trap is now undispellable, but has a 4 sec duration."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203376] = "Emmarel Shadewarden was a young Sentinel when the Unseen Path was founded. Like her mentor, Namuria Gladesong, Emmarel believed that the night elves had a duty to protect Azeroth from the inevitable return of the Legion. After her order was all but wiped out in the War of the Shifting Sands, Emmarel kept the Unseen Path small and secluded, watching for the day when it should rise again.00During the long years of her vigil, Emmarel studied the ways of the beast master. She is never far from the wings of her beloved eagle companion, Snowfeather."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203413] = "Furiously strikes all enemies in front of you, dealing 748 Physical damage over 2.7 sec. Critical strike chance increased by 50% against any target below 20% health. Deals reduced damage beyond 8 targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203415] = "Furiously strikes all enemies in front of you, dealing 748 Physical damage over 2.7 sec. Critical strike chance increased by 50% against any target below 20% health. Deals reduced damage beyond 8 targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203513] = "Your tattoos reduce all damage taken by 12%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203524] = "Enter a defensive posture, critically blocking all attacks while a stream of shadowflame erupts from Scale of the Earth-Warder, dealing 40 Shadowflame over 3 sec to all enemies in front of you. You can use defensive abilities while this is active."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203526] = "Enter a defensive posture, critically blocking all attacks while a stream of shadowflame erupts from Scale of the Earth-Warder, dealing 40 Shadowflame over 3 sec to all enemies in front of you. You can use defensive abilities while this is active."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203550] = "Eye Beam generates 10 Fury every second, has 10% increased duration, and deals 10% increased damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203555] = "Your auto attacks deal an additional 16 Shadow damage and generate 10-16 Fury."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203624] = "Wild Growth is now instant cast, and when you heal 6 allies with Wild Growth you gain Full Bloom. This effect has a 30 sec cooldown.\n\nFull Bloom\nYour next Wild Growth applies Lifebloom to all targets at 100% effectiveness. Lasts for 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203638] = "Increases damage dealt by Raptor Strike by 15%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203651] = "Nature's Swiftness causes your next Regrowth to apply Lifebloom, Rejuvenation, and Wild Growth effects to an ally."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203720] = "Surge with fel power, increasing your Armor by 75."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203724] = "Gives a chance to parry enemy melee attacks."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203747] = "Increases Armor by 57.3% of your Agility. Armor bonus is doubled while Demon Spikes is active."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203782] = "Shears an enemy for 22 Physical damage, and shatters a Lesser Soul Fragment from your target.\n\nGenerates 10 Fury."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203783] = "Shear shatters the target's soul, leaving a Lesser Soul Fragment behind for 25 sec.\n\nConsuming a Lesser Soul Fragment heals you for 6% of all damage taken in the last 5 sec, minimum 1% of maximum health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203953] = "Sharp brambles protect you, absorbing and reflecting up to 8 damage from each attack.\n\nWhile Barkskin is active, the brambles also deal 2 Nature damage to all nearby enemies every 1 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203962] = "Thrash also generates 3 Rage each time it deals damage, on up to 5 targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203964] = "Your damage has a 5% chance to trigger a free automatic Moonfire on that target.\n\n Moonfire:\nWhen this occurs, the next Moonfire you cast generates 8 Rage, and deals 300% increased direct damage.\n\n Red Moon:\nWhen this occurs, you gain 1 charge of Lunar Wrath. Each 20 Rage you spend while Red Moon is active consumes a stack to deal 380 additional Arcane damage to its target and heal you for 494."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[203965] = "Reduces the cooldowns of Barkskin and Survival Instincts by 12%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204018] = "Blesses a party or raid member, granting immunity to magical damage and harmful effects for 10 sec.\n\nCannot be used on a target with Forbearance. Causes Forbearance for 30 sec.\n\nShares a cooldown with Blessing of Protection."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204019] = "Throws a Blessed Hammer that spirals outward, dealing 11 Holy damage to enemies and reducing the next damage they deal to you by 11.\n\nGenerates 1 Holy Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204021] = "Brand yourself and an enemy target with demonic symbols, reducing the damage you take by 40% and instantly dealing 147 Fire damage to the enemy."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204023] = "Judgment now has 2 charges, and Grand Crusader now also reduces the cooldown of Judgment by 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204053] = "Each stack of Thrash reduces the target's damage to you by 3% and increases your damage to them by 2%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204054] = "Your Consecration is 15% larger, and enemies within it have 50% reduced movement speed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204066] = "Summons a beam of lunar light at your target's location, dealing 14 Arcane damage each second to your target and 13 to up to 5 other enemies within 8 yd. \n\nLunar Beam also increases your mastery by 18%, and heals you for 981 over 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204074] = "Avenging Wrath and Sentinel have 50% reduced cooldown and 40% reduced duration."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204077] = "During Divine Shield, all targets within 15 yds are taunted."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204080] = "Your Remorseless Winter and Chains of Ice apply Deathchill, rooting the target in place for 4 sec.\n\nRemorseless Winter \nAll targets within 8 yards are afflicted with Deathchill when Remorseless Winter is cast.\n\nChains of Ice\nWhen you Chains of Ice a target already afflicted by your Chains of Ice they will be afflicted by Deathchill."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204089] = "When your abilities damage a target below 20% health, you gain 1% increased critical strike chance for 6 sec, stacking up to 30 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204147] = "Focuses the power of Wind through Thas'dorah, dealing 272 Physical damage to your target, and leaving behind a trail of wind for 5 sec that increases the movement speed of allies by 50%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204157] = "Throw a demonic glaive at the target, dealing 7 Physical damage. The glaive can ricochet to an additional enemy within 10 yards. Generates high threat."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204254] = "Killing a target will sometimes shatter their soul, leaving a Soul Fragment behind for 20 sec.\n\nThe Soul Fragment will be consumed when you approach it, healing you for 150 health.\n\nConsuming a Lesser Soul Fragment heals you for 6% of all damage taken in the last 5 sec, minimum 1% of maximum health.\n\nConsuming a Demon's soul will grant you 20% increased damage for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204268] = "Your Hex target is slowed by 70% during Hex and for 6 sec after it ends.\n\nReduces the cooldown of Hex by 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204287] = "Teleports the caster to the Hall of the Guardian."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204331] = "Summons a totem at your feet for 15 sec.\n\nWhenever enemies within 20 yards of the totem deal direct damage, the totem will deal 100% of the damage dealt back to attacker."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204336] = "Summons a totem at your feet that will redirect all harmful spells cast within 30 yards on a nearby party or raid member to itself. Will not redirect area of effect spells. Lasts 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204403] = "Thunderstorm now can be cast on allies within 40 yards, reduces enemies movement speed by 60%, and knocks enemies 25% further."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204596] = "Place a Sigil of Flame at the target location that activates after 2 sec.\n\nDeals 28 Fire damage, and an additional 70 Fire damage over 8 sec, to all enemies affected by the sigil.\n\nGenerates 25 Fury."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204874] = "You will learn how to teleport to the Emerald Dreamway."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[204909] = "Leech increased by 6%.\n\nGain an additional 6% leech while Metamorphosis is active."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205020] = "Casting Pyroblast or Flamestrike while Hot Streak is active has an 8% chance to instantly reactivate Hot Streak."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205021] = "Channel an icy beam at the enemy for 3.6 sec, dealing 1,898 Frost damage every 0.45 sec.\n\nApplies 8 stacks of Freezing over its duration."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205022] = "Casting Arcane Intellect summons a Familiar that attacks your enemies and increases your maximum mana by 10% for 1 hour."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205023] = "Fireball and Pyroblast apply Conflagration to the target, dealing an additional 33 Fire damage over 8 sec.\n\nEnemies affected by either Conflagration or Ignite have a 15% chance to flare up and deal 27 Fire damage to nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205024] = "Spell damage increased by 3%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205025] = "Causes your next 2 Arcane Blasts to be instant cast."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205026] = "Your Fireball and Pyroblast spells always deal a critical strike when the target is above 90% health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205027] = "Whenever you attempt to chill a target, you gain Bone Chilling, increasing spell damage you deal by 0.5% for 8 sec, stacking up to 10 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205028] = "Arcane Barrage deals 8% increased damage per target it hits beyond the first."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205029] = "Fire Blast gains 1 additional charge and its cooldown is reduced by 2.0 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205030] = "Frostbolt grants you Fingers of Frost 25% more often and Brain Freeze 20% more often."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205036] = "Frost Nova now has 2 charges."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205037] = "Flamestrike leaves behind a patch of flames that burns enemies within it for 380 Fire damage over 6 sec. Deals reduced damage beyond 8 targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205065] = "Raise your dagger into the sky, channeling a torrent of void energy into the target for 1,146 Shadow damage over 4 sec. Insanity does not drain during this channel.\n\nRequires Voidform."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205145] = "Shadow Bolt has a 20% chance to make your next Call Dreadstalkers cost 2 fewer Soul Shards and have no cast time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205147] = "You gain up to 30% movement speed  and 15% magical damage reduction based on your current level of Stagger."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205148] = "Your spells have a chance to grant you 15% Haste for 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205154] = "Allows you to tame pets in the Mechanical family."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205179] = "Places a phantom singularity above the target, which consumes the life of all enemies within 15 yards, dealing 828 damage over 14.3 sec, healing you for 25% of the damage done."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205180] = "Summons a Darkglare from the Twisting Nether that increases the damage of your Agony, Corruption, and Unstable Affliction by 20% while active.\n\nThe Darkglare will serve you for 20 sec, blasting its target for 1,857 Shadow damage, increased by 10% for every damage over time effect you have active on their current target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205184] = "Conflagrate increases your Immolate, Incinerate, and Conflagrate damage to the target by 25% for 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205223] = "Strikes all enemies in front of you with a hungering attack that deals 87 Physical damage and heals you for 100% of that damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205224] = "Strikes all enemies in front of you with a hungering attack that deals 87 Physical damage and heals you for 100% of that damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205273] = "Lash out with the Ashbringer, dealing 61 Radiant damage to all enemies within 12 yd in front of you, and reducing movement speed by 50% for 6 sec.\n\nDemon and Undead enemies are stunned for 6 sec if struck by the Wake of Ashes."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205364] = "Controls a mind up to 1 level above yours for 30 sec while still controlling your own mind. Does not work versus Demonic, Mechanical, or Undead beings or players. This spell shares diminishing returns with other disorienting effects."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205406] = "Draws in all nearby clouds of mist generated by Sheilun, healing the target for 190 per cloud absorbed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205411] = "Blur now reduces damage taken by an additional 10%.\n\nAdditionally, damage taken below 35% Health is reduced by 10%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205495] = "Raises The Fist of Ra-den to the sky and absorbs all nearby electric energy, causing your next 3 casts of Lightning Bolt or Chain Lightning to be instant and deal 200% increased damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205545] = "Unleashes the fiery power Odyn bestowed the Warswords, dealing 182 Fire damage and an additional 29 Fire damage over 4 sec to all enemies within 14 yards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205546] = "Unleashes the fiery power Odyn bestowed the Warswords, dealing 182 Fire damage and an additional 29 Fire damage over 4 sec to all enemies within 14 yards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205547] = "Unleashes the fiery power Odyn bestowed the Warswords, dealing 182 Fire damage and an additional 29 Fire damage over 4 sec to all enemies within 14 yards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205596] = "Imprison's PvP duration is increased by 1 sec, and targets become immune to damage and healing while imprisoned."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205604] = "Removes all harmful magical effects from yourself and all nearby allies within 10 yards, and sends them back to their original caster if possible."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205625] = "Immolation Aura dispels a magical effect on you when cast."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205626] = "Dealing damage increases your movement speed by 15% for 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205627] = "While Demon Spikes is active, melee attacks against you cause Physical damage equal to 30% of the damage taken back to the attacker."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205629] = "Transform to demon form, moving at 175% increased speed for 3 sec, knocking down all enemies in your path and dealing 5 Physical damage.\n\nDuring Demonic Trample you are unaffected by snares but cannot cast spells or use your normal attacks. Shares charges with Infernal Strike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205630] = "You strangle the target with demonic magic, stunning them in place and dealing 392 Shadow damage over 5 sec while the target is grasped. Can move while channeling.\n\nUse Illidan's Grasp again to toss the target to a location within 20 yards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205636] = "Summons a stand of 3 Treants for 10 sec which immediately taunt and attack enemies in the targeted area.\n\nGenerates 20 Astral Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205673] = "Interrupting a spell with Skull Bash reduces the remaining cooldown of Tiger's Fury, Survival Instincts, and Dash by 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205723] = "Reduces the cooldown on Vampiric Blood by 2.0 sec per 10 Runic Power spent."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205727] = "Reduces the cooldown of Anti-Magic Shell by 20 sec and increases its duration and amount absorbed by 40%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[205800] = "You focus the assault on this target, increasing their damage taken by 3% for 6 sec. Each unique player that attacks the target increases the damage taken by an additional 3%, stacking up to 5 times.\n\nYour melee attacks refresh the duration of Focused Assault."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206315] = "Execute is usable on targets below 35% health and its cooldown is reduced by 1.5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206416] = "Blade Dance deals 101 Chaos damage to the first target struck."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206476] = "The Hunt and Vengeful Retreat increase your damage by 5% for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206477] = "Reduces the Fury cost of Chaos Nova by 50% and its cooldown by 20%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206478] = "Chaos Strike has a chance to spawn a Lesser Soul Fragment. Consuming any Soul Fragment grants 20 Fury."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206572] = "Run at high speed at a distance in front of you. All enemies in your path will take 25 Physical damage and be knocked back."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206642] = "When you successfully Purge a beneficial effect, the enemy suffers 2,154 Nature damage over 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206803] = "You fly into the air out of harm's way. While floating, you gain access to Fel Lance allowing you to deal damage to enemies below."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206930] = "Instantly strike the target and 1 other nearby enemy, causing 68 Physical damage, and reducing enemies' movement speed by 20% for 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206931] = "Drains 89 health from the target over 2.7 sec. The damage they deal to you is reduced by 15% for the duration and 5 sec after channeling it fully.\n\nYou can move, parry, dodge, and use defensive abilities while channeling this ability.\n\nGenerates 20 additional Runic Power over the duration."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206967] = "Damage taken below 30% Health is reduced by 20%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206970] = "Gorefiend's Grasp cooldown is reduced by 30 sec and it now also Silences enemies for 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[206974] = "Each charge of Bone Shield increases your maximum health by 1%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207017] = "You focus the assault on this target, increasing their damage taken by 3% for 6 sec. Each unique player that attacks the target increases the damage taken by an additional 3%, stacking up to 5 times.\n\nYour melee attacks refresh the duration of Focused Assault."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207018] = "You focus the assault on this target, increasing their damage taken by 3% for 6 sec. Each unique player that attacks the target increases the damage taken by an additional 3%, stacking up to 5 times.\n\nYour melee attacks refresh the duration of Focused Assault."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207025] = "You focus the assault on this target, increasing their damage taken by 3% for 6 sec. Each unique player that attacks the target increases the damage taken by an additional 3%, stacking up to 5 times.\n\nYour melee attacks refresh the duration of Focused Assault."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207028] = "You focus the assault on this target, increasing their damage taken by 3% for 6 sec. Each unique player that attacks the target increases the damage taken by an additional 3%, stacking up to 5 times.\n\nYour melee attacks refresh the duration of Focused Assault."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207029] = "You focus the assault on this target, increasing their damage taken by 3% for 6 sec. Each unique player that attacks the target increases the damage taken by an additional 3%, stacking up to 5 times.\n\nYour melee attacks refresh the duration of Focused Assault."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207057] = "When Frost Strike damages an enemy with 5 stacks of Razorice it will consume them to deal an additional 115% damage.\n\nFrostbane consumes the Razorice on your main target to deal an additional 300% damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207061] = "Consuming the Killing Machine effect has a 20% chance to grant you 1 Rune."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207068] = "Discharge a massive jolt of electricity from Titanstrike into all your pets and Dire Beasts, causing them to deal up to 20 Nature damage to their target every 1 sec. for 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207097] = "Discharge a massive jolt of electricity from Titanstrike into all your pets and Dire Beasts, causing them to deal up to 20 Nature damage to their target every 1 sec. for 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207104] = "Auto attacks have a chance to generate 3 Runic Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207142] = "Casting Howling Blast with Rime active causes jagged icicles to fall on enemies nearby your target, applying Razorice and dealing 8 Frost damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207167] = "Targets in a cone in front of you are blinded, causing them to wander disoriented for 5 sec. Damage may cancel the effect.\n\nWhen Blinding Sleet ends, enemies are slowed by 50% for 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207197] = "You gain Parry equal to 100% of your Critical Strike from gear."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207200] = "Your auto attack damage grants you an absorb shield equal to 50% of the damage dealt."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207217] = "The leader of the Shado-pan, an order dedicated to protecting Pandaria from the sha, Taran Zhu is a skilled fighter and fearless leader."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207219] = "The Monkey King was the trusted companion of Shaohao, emperor of all Pandaria. He is mischievous, cunning, and knows untold secrets about Pandaria's past."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207220] = "Angus Ironfist was born into this world with a desire to fight. He loves going toe-to-toe with any rival, and can best them with a combination of martial combat, grapples, wrestling, and well-timed punches and kicks."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207222] = "Hiro has wandered the world for many years, ambling aimlessly from one tavern to another in search of the next drink. Don't be fooled by his unkempt appearance - not only does he have a heart of gold, but the more drinks he's had, the better he fights."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207223] = "Sylara Shadowheart is a mysterious wanderer who rarely speaks about her past. One thing is clear - nothing makes her angrier than injustice. Anyone who crosses her will get a taste of her twin blades."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207225] = "Aegira is a vrykul brewmaster, favored by Odyn himself. Her brews are legendary. Little do others know, her brawling skills are formidable. She grew up on the battlefield, and is still undefeated by all who challenge her."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207230] = "A sweeping attack that strikes all enemies in front of you for 16 Frost damage. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets. \n\nConsumes Killing Machine to have its critical strikes deal 4 times the normal damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207235] = "Consular Celestos is one of the most ancient and venerable elementals within Skywall.\n\nDuring the reign of Al'Akir, Celestos was a chief advisor and tactician during many of the Windlord's campaigns."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207236] = "A former paladin, Farseer Noundo was the first of his people to become a shaman and learn the way of the elements.\n\nHe is one of the wisest and most powerful shaman in the Earthen Ring, and the former leader of the order."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207237] = "Rehgar Earthfury is a powerful elemental shaman and former gladiator who has mastered the ways of combat.00There are few members of the Earthen Ring who can match Rehgar's experience and prowess on the battlefield."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207238] = "Formerly a lieutenant of Ragnaros, Baron Scaldius now serves Firelord Smolderon with unwaivering loyalty.00With the power and fury of the Firelands at his command, Baron Scaldius will incinerate any and all foes that cross his path."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207239] = "Among the great Stone Lords of Deepholm, Avalanchion is known for being virtually indestructible.00Avalanchion easily ignores mortal sensations such as fear and pain and will fulfill his master's commands with unyielding focus."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[207240] = "A former leader of the Earthen Ring, Muln Earthfury is one of the greatest shaman of his generation.00His imposing presence on the battlefield and his mastery of the 'old ways' of shamanism make him a valuable ally."
