WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[212552] = "Embrace the power of the Shadowlands, removing all root effects and increasing your movement speed by 70% for 4 sec. Taking any action cancels the effect.\n\nWhile active, your movement speed cannot be reduced below 170%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[212638] = "Hurl a net at your enemy, rooting them for 6 sec. While within the net, the target's chance to hit is reduced by 80%. Any damage will break the net."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[212640] = "Instantly clears all bleeds, poisons, and diseases from the target, and heals for 18% damage over 6 sec.\n\nBeing attacked will stop you from using Mending Bandage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[212653] = "Teleports you 20 yds forward, unless something is in the way. Unaffected by the global cooldown and castable while casting."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[213010] = "You heal for 3% of all Fire damage you deal."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[213200] = "Your Stampeding Roar clears all roots and snares from yourself and allies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[213410] = "Eye Beam causes you to enter demon form for 5 sec after it finishes dealing damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[213480] = "Taking damage causes you to gain Fury based on the damage dealt."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[213634] = "Removes all Disease effects from a friendly target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[213644] = "Cleanses a friendly target, removing all Poison and Disease effects."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[213691] = "A short-range shot that deals 1 damage, removes all harmful damage over time effects, and incapacitates the target for 3 sec.  Any damage caused will remove the effect. Turns off your attack when used."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[213764] = "Swipe nearby enemies, inflicting Physical damage. Damage varies by shapeshift form."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[213871] = "Protect an ally, causing 40% of all Physical damage they take to be transfered to you. When the target takes Physical damage, your Shield Slam cooldown has a 30% chance to be reset. Bodyguard is cancelled if the target is further than 20 yards from you. Lasts 1 min.\n\nOnly one target can be Bodyguarded at a time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[213915] = "Spell Reflection reflects the next 2 incoming spells cast on you and reflected spells deal 100% extra damage to the attacker.\n\nSpell Reflection's cooldown is increased by 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[214205] = "Atonement duration increased by 10 sec.\n\nSmite, Penance, Mind Blast, and Void Blast have 10% reduced cast time when you have Atonement on 3 or more allies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[214634] = "Deals 1,222 Shadowfrost damage and causes Brain Freeze."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[214743] = "Carve into the soul of your target, dealing 171 Fire damage and an additional 104 Fire damage over 3 sec.  Immediately shatters 3 Soul Fragments from the target and 1 additional Soul Fragment every 1 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[214826] = "Increases damage dealt by Aimed Shot by 12%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215001] = "As the master architect of Illidan's plan to destroy the Burning Legion, and head of the Ashtongue tribe, Akama has proven to be a resourceful leader as well as a brilliant strategist and skilled fighter."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215116] = "As the master architect of Illidan's plan to destroy the Burning Legion, and head of the Ashtongue tribe, Akama proved himself to be a resourceful leader as well as a brilliant strategist and skilled fighter. His Shade is all of that and more."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215117] = "Malevolence has proven herself time and again to be an invaluable ally. It is an absolutely certainty that if it weren't for her, you would not be standing here. Her leadership skills are matched only by her mastery of demonic magic."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215129] = "When no one else would stand against Illidan's method of fighting the Burning Legion regardless of the cost, there was Altruis. As strong a demon hunter as you have ever known, his fighting ability is topped only by his keen intellect and the respect he has gained for pushing to change the methods of the Illidari."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215133] = "Throughout everything, Kayn has been the rock upon which all else breaks. Where others began to question Illidan's methods, Kayn stood resolute, insisting that the destruction of the Burning Legion was all that mattered. He is a puisant fighter, skill tactician, and unparalleled politician."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215138] = "Asha Ravensong is the most loyal and dedicated of the Illidari. She is quiet, thoughtful, and deadly. When she takes action, her decisions are spot on and because of this, she has gained the respect everyone around her. There are few that can outlast her in combat and fewer still that can outmatch her in wits."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215148] = "Kor'vas is renowned for her unparalleled skill at arms. There are those who say that she has the potential to rival even Illidan's skill with the warglaives. She's also known for her quick temper and ferocity in battle, leaving no foe alive in her wake."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215279] = "Unleashes a devastating blast of chaos, causing 760 Chaos damage. Chaos Bolt always critically strikes and your critical strike chance increases its damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215537] = "Slam, Whirlwind, and Execute now cause the target to bleed for 20% additional damage over 6 sec. Multiple uses accumulate increased damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215568] = "Bloodthirst always Enrages you the first time you strike a target and it has a 15% increased chance to trigger Enrage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215652] = "When activated, your next Avenger's Shield will interrupt and silence all enemies within 8 yds of the target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215661] = "Focuses Holy energy to deliver a powerful weapon strike that deals 47 Holy damage, and restores 3% of your maximum health.\n\nDamage is increased by 25% when used against a stunned target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215768] = "The damage of Smite and Penance is increased by 8%, and Penance increases or decreases your target's movement speed by 25% for 2 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215769] = "The Priest becomes the Spirit of Redemption for 6 sec. The Spirit of Redemption cannot move, attack, be attacked or targeted by any spells or effects. While in this form the Priest can cast any healing spell free of cost."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215941] = "Every Soul Shard you spend has a 5% chance to be refunded."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[215982] = "Your Spirit of Redemption is now an active ability with a 2 minute cooldown, but the duration is reduced by 9 sec and you will no longer enter Spirit of Redemption upon dying."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216031] = "One of the quieter Illidari, Belath nonetheless is also one of its most capable. He shows an incredible aptitude for scouting, stealth, and creative approaches to tactical situations."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216231] = "Reduces the materials required to craft a Warhide Mask."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216232] = "Reduces the materials required to craft Warhide Gloves."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216233] = "Reduces the materials required to craft Warhide Pants."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216234] = "Reduces the materials required to craft Battlebound Grips."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216235] = "Reduces the materials required to craft a Battlebound Warhelm."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216236] = "Reduces the materials required to craft Battlebound Leggings."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216331] = "You become the ultimate crusader of light, for 15 sec. Auto-attack damage is increased by 1,000%, Judgment and Crusader Strike heal up to 5 injured allies within 40 yds for 55% of the damage done, split evenly among them.\n\nThis spell is replaced with Crusader Strike while active.\n\nCrusader Strike:\nStrike the target for 49 Physical damage.\n\nGenerates 1 Holy Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216519] = "You have a chance equal to your critical strike chance to be healed for an additional 70% of the amount healed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216698] = "Consume all Tormented Souls collected by Ulthalesh, increasing your damage by 10% and doubling the effect of all of Ulthalesh's other traits for 5 sec per soul consumed.\n\nUlthalesh collects Tormented Souls from each target you kill and occasionally escaped souls it previously collected."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216785] = "An emissary from the Skyhorn tribe, Loren Stormhoof is a long-standing ally of the Unseen Path. His knowledge of the native flora and fauna is unsurpassed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216787] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216788] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216789] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216790] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216791] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216793] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216853] = "Reduces the cooldown of your Blessing of Protection and Blessing of Sacrifice by 33%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216855] = "Your Flash of Light reduces all damage the target receives by 10% for 6 sec. Stacks up to 2 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216868] = "Your Consecration clears and suppresses all snare effects on allies within its area of effect."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216923] = "Aponi Brightmane, leader of the nascent Sunwalker paladins, united her people around a thirst for truth and understanding. What is the true nature of the Light? Why does it grant us its strength? Aponi intends to answer her burning questions, but she has no problem in casting aside anyone or anything that gets in her way."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216924] = "Aponi Brightmane, leader of the nascent Sunwalker paladins, united her people around a thirst for truth and understanding. What is the true nature of the Light? Why does it grant us its strength? Aponi intends to answer her burning questions, but she has no problem in casting aside anyone or anything that gets in her way."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216925] = "Aponi Brightmane, leader of the nascent Sunwalker paladins, united her people around a thirst for truth and understanding. What is the true nature of the Light? Why does it grant us its strength? Aponi intends to answer her burning questions, but she has no problem in casting aside anyone or anything that gets in her way."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[216926] = "Aponi Brightmane, leader of the nascent Sunwalker paladins, united her people around a thirst for truth and understanding. What is the true nature of the Light? Why does it grant us its strength? Aponi intends to answer her burning questions, but she has no problem in casting aside anyone or anything that gets in her way."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[217200] = "Fire a shot that tears through your enemy, causing them to bleed for 150 damage over 12 sec. If Barbed Shot is reapplied, any remaining damage will be added to the new Barbed Shot.\n\nGenerates 20 Focus over 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[217762] = "Learn how to craft a Tome of Illusions: Elemental Lords."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[217832] = "Imprisons a demon, beast, or humanoid, incapacitating them for 1 min. Damage may cancel the effect. Limit 1."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[218022] = "Unlocks the Aegwynn's Fall, Lavaborn Edge, and Archmagi's Will artifact appearances."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[218164] = "Removes all Poison and Disease effects from the target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[218612] = "Every 20 Fury spent reduces the remaining cooldown of Demon Spikes by 1.00 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[218670] = "Most think to this day that the infamous leader of the Defias Brotherhood died in the Deadmines years ago thanks to an elixir that mimiced death and flame retardant armor. In truth, the wayward daughter of Westfall found her way into the secretive order of the Uncrowned, where her anti-government motives were well at home. She quickly rose through the ranks to the mysterious Shadows, poised to finally have the means to enact her revenge."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[218681] = "Allari the Souleater is the wielder of the artifact known as the Scythe of Souls. In addition to her own magical mastery over capturing demon souls, the Scythe grants her incredible powers. Few others are as effective in bringing the Burning Legion to its knees."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[218682] = "In his former life, before making the ritualistic changes to become one of the Illidari, Jace was a powerful mage. He still retains much of his magic knowledge. Combined with his mastery over the fel energies coursing through his body, he has created many useful devices for the Illidari, such as the nether crucibles, demon traps, and wards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[218708] = "Troop recruitment cost reduced by 25%"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[219272] = "Your Soul Leech absorption now passively recharges at a rate of 0.2% of maximum health every 1 sec, and may now absorb an additional 5% of maximum health.\n\nIncreases your armor by 45%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[219663] = "Unlocks the Guardian Spire, Pride of the Sunstriders, and Guardian's Focus artifact appearances."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[219756] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[219757] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[219758] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[219759] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[219761] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[219762] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[219763] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[219764] = "[WRITE TEXT HERE]"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[219786] = "While you have at least 5 Bone Shield charges, the cost of Death Strike is reduced by 5 Runic Power.\n\nAdditionally, your maximum Runic Power is increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[220143] = "Strikes the enemy, dealing 3 Physical damage and bursting up to 6 Festering Wounds on the target, summoning a member of your Army of the Dead for 20 sec for each burst Festering Wound."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[220172] = "Some would say that there is no finer assassin in the world than Valeera. Garona might disagree, but Valeera's track record speaks for itself. She is also known to have quite the temper, so it's best to stay on her good side."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[220357] = "Spinning Crane Kick's damage is increased by 18% for each unique target you've struck in the last 20 sec with Tiger Palm, Blackout Kick, or Rising Sun Kick. \n\nStacks up to 5 times and only applies to the primary target of each effect."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221351] = "Increases your chance to critically strike by 5%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221533] = "Strength increased by 5."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221534] = "Intellect increased by 5."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221535] = "Agility increased by 5."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221536] = "Your Heart Strike generates 2 additional Runic Power per target hit."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221562] = "Lifts the enemy target off the ground, crushing their throat with dark energy and stunning them for 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221615] = "Increases your out-of-combat regeneration in outdoor Broken Isles zones."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221617] = "While you are below 35% health you take 50% reduced damage in outdoor Broken Isles zones."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221620] = "Spending a Rune has a chance to increase your Mastery by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221622] = "Tricks of the Trade now increases the friendly target's damage by 15% for 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221632] = "Chaos Strike and Soul Cleave have a chance to increase your Haste by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221636] = "Mangle, Starsurge, and Regrowth have a chance to increase your Mastery by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221638] = "Your finishing moves have a chance to increase your Haste by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221642] = "Kill Command, Aimed Shot, and Mongoose Bite have a chance to increase your Haste by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221646] = "Frostbolt, Fireball, and Arcane Blast have a chance to increase your Mastery by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221653] = "Holy Light, Crusader Strike, and Avenger's Shield have a chance to increase your Haste by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221655] = "Heal, Smite, and Mind Blast have a chance to increase your Mastery by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221662] = "Your finishing moves have a chance to increase your Haste by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221664] = "Lightning Bolt, Stormstrike, and Healing Wave have a chance to increase your Critical Strike by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221667] = "Spending a Soul Shard has a chance to increase your Mastery by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221669] = "Mortal Strike, Bloodthirst, and Shield Slam have a chance to increase your Critical Strike by 20 for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221711] = "Whenever you heal yourself with Drain Life, the enemy target deals 9% reduced damage to you for 10 sec. Stacks up to 4 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221778] = "No rogue ever stealthed so well as Taoshi. If she does not want to be seen, she is not. This makes her especially deadly as it is nigh impossible to prevent her from executing a sneak attack from behind."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[221779] = "Master Mathias Shaw is the espionage core of the Alliance. He advises the king on all matters of intel and strategy. He has agreed to an off-the-books alliance as long as you are a representative of the Uncrowned."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[223218] = "Grants access to the Brewhouse."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[223413] = "Grants access to the Teleportation Nexus."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[223817] = "Holy Power spending abilities have a 15% chance to make your next Holy Power spending ability free and deal 15% increased damage and healing."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[223826] = "Soothe up to 3 withered in the targeted area, sending them to Shal'Aran."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[224135] = "Unlocks the Magna Unleashed, Phoenix's Rebirth, and Flow of the First artifact appearances."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[224146] = "Your spells have a chance to increase your Haste by 30 for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[224148] = "Your spells and attacks have a chance to increase your Mastery by 30 for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[224150] = "Your spells and attacks have a chance to increase your Critical Strike by 30 for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[224186] = "Kills increase movement speed by 50% for 15 sec. \n\nRequires you to be in Suramar."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[224189] = "You attract the power of the ancient leylines, causing Leyline Rifts to appear during combat.\n\nYou gain Ancient Mana while standing in a Leyline Rift. \n\nEnemies in a Leyline Rift suffer periodic damage.\n\nRequires you to be in Suramar."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[224772] = "When you would take fatal damage, you instead create an arcane barrier, restoring health and granting immunity for 5 sec, but during that time you cannot attack, move, or cast spells.\n\nEnemies who touch the barrier suffer damage and are knocked away.\n\nRequires you to be in Suramar."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[224869] = "Teleports you to Dalaran in the Broken Isles."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[224871] = "Creates a portal, teleporting group members that use it to Dalaran in the Broken Isles."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[224968] = "Creates a rune around the target, inflicting 912 Arcane damage over 6 sec to all enemies within 6 yds, and then detonating for Arcane damage equal to 20% of your maximum mana."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225061] = "Marin Noggenfogger is quite possibly the world's greatest alchemist. What he lacks in brawn, he more than makes up for in resourcefulness. Never underestimate the power of goblin ingenuity... and goblin greed!"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225077] = "Fleet Admiral Tethys may be a scurvy pirate, but he's also one of the greatest swashbucklers of The Great Sea. He currently leads the infamous Bloodsail Buccaneers of Booty Bay as the Fleet Admiral."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225088] = "Lord Ravenholdt is one of the most legendary rogues of all time. For decades, he has trained many of the greatest rogues in the arts of subtlety and diversion."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225092] = "Reduces the cooldown of your Aspects by 10%"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225575] = "There are few among the Knights of the Ebon Blade with more loyalty than Thassarian. His unwavering conviction and prowess in battle has earned him the respect of all within the order."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225577] = "In life, Nazgrim was one of the greatest generals of the Horde. In death, he is a powerful champion of the Ebon Blade. Few, living or dead, can match his might in battle."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225580] = "Within the ranks of the Ebon Blade there are few death knights who can match the swiftness and agility of Koltira Deathweaver. His prowess with the runeblade is legendary."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225587] = "In all the annals of history, there are few warriors more legendary than King Thoras Trollbane. As a king, he was respected. As a death knight of the Four Horsemen, he will be feared."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225692] = "In life, High Inquisitor Whitemane was a zealous priestess of the Light who was enslaved by madness. Freed from the insanity of her mind through death, she is now a ruthless death knight with an unquenchable thirst for vengeance."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225701] = "The abomination is one of the Archlich Kel'Thuzad's most utilitarian creations. What could be more useful than a gigantic, malformed monstrosity with perfect loyalty and a voracious hunger to devour enemies. As abominations go, Rottgut is a perfect specimen."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225703] = "Amal'thazad was once a powerful frost mage who fought against the forces of the Lich King. Arthas, impressed with the mage's power, raised him into undeath as the lich Amal'thazad."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225705] = "The former leader of the Knights of the Ebon Blade, Highlord Darion Mograine is one of the most powerful death knights ever created. He now leads the Four Horsemen against the Burning Legion as the harbinger of death and destruction."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225835] = "Blesses the target with the ability to pierce the Nightmare's veil, allowing Malfurion to offer direct passage to confront Cenarius on Normal difficulty."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225838] = "Blesses the target with the ability to pierce the Nightmare's veil, allowing Malfurion to offer direct passage to confront Cenarius on Normal or Heroic difficulty."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[225839] = "Blesses the target with the ability to pierce the Nightmare's veil, allowing Malfurion to offer direct passage to confront Cenarius on any difficulty."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[226359] = "Increases your Stamina by 5% while wearing only leather armor."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[226856] = "Increase the maximum amount of Ancient Mana you can carry by 200."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[226857] = "Increase the maximum amount of Ancient Mana you can carry by 200."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[226862] = "Increase the maximum amount of Ancient Mana you can carry by 200."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[226865] = "Increase the maximum amount of Ancient Mana you can carry by 300."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[226869] = "Increase the maximum amount of Ancient Mana you can carry by 300."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[226941] = "Grants a chance to loot additional Ancient Mana from creatures in Suramar."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[226945] = "Increases your chance to loot additional Ancient Mana from creatures in Suramar."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[226946] = "Further increases your chance to loot additional Ancient Mana from creatures in Suramar."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[227057] = "Maximum focus increased by 5%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[227174] = "Immolation Aura's initial burst has a chance to shatter Soul Fragments from enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[227303] = "Unlocks access to World Quests in the Broken Isles."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[227847] = "Become an unstoppable storm of destructive force, striking all nearby enemies for 665 Physical damage over 5.4 sec. Deals reduced damage beyond 8 targets.\n\nYou are immune to movement impairing and loss of control effects, but can use defensive abilities and can avoid attacks."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[227892] = "Perform a deadly ritual to summon a random demon. Requires at least 3 participants."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[228049] = "Empowers the friendly target with the spirit of the forgotten queen, causing the target to be immune to all damage for 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[228260] = "Bombards your target with a Void Volley and twists your Shadowform with void magic, increasing your spell damage by 20% for 20 sec. \n\nDuring Voidform, Void Volley replaces this spell and can be used up to 3 times.\n\n Void Volley\nReleases a volley of pure void energy, firing 10 bolts at your target and 1 bolt at all enemies within 10 yards of your target for 362 Shadow damage.\n\nGenerates 10 Insanity."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[228264] = "Twists your Shadowform with the powers of the Void for 20 sec, increasing your spell damage by 20% and replaces Void Eruption with Void Volley.\n\n Void Volley\nReleases a volley of pure void energy, firing 10 bolts at your target and 1 bolt at all enemies within 10 yards of your target for 362 Shadow damage.\n\nGenerates 10 Insanity."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[228266] = "For the duration of Voidform, your Void Eruption ability is replaced by Void Bolt:"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[228431] = "Increases the range of your Skull Bash by 10 yards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[228445] = "Your spells and attacks against Demons have a chance to deal an additional 114 Fire damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[228447] = "The effect from Chrono Shard now increases your Speed by 60, and grants an additional 15 Haste."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[228448] = "Your spells and attacks have a chance to increase your Versatility by 34 for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[228477] = "Viciously strike an enemy and all other enemies in front of you for 73 Physical damage and heal yourself for 103. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets.\n\nConsumes up to 2 Soul Fragments, increasing damage by 20% per fragment consumed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[228597] = "Launches a bolt of frost at the enemy, causing 1,038 Frost damage and slowing movement speed by 50% for 8 sec."
