WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299336] = "Focus excess Azerite energy into the Heart of Azeroth, then expel that energy outward, dealing 5,857 Fire damage to all enemies in front of you over 2.7 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299337] = "Your damaging spells and abilities grant you 3 Haste for 4 sec, stacking up to 10 times. This Haste is lost if you stop using spells or abilities against the initial target.\n\nWhen you have no stacks of Focused Energy, generate 3 stacks from your first damaging spell or ability."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299338] = "Focus excess Azerite energy into the Heart of Azeroth, then expel that energy outward, dealing 5,857 Fire damage to all enemies in front of you over 2.7 sec. Castable while moving."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299343] = "MOTHER has added a Purification Protocol to your Heart of Azeroth, allowing your damaging spells and abilities to release a blast of Azerite energy at your target, dealing 370 Fire damage to any enemy within 8 yds, and heals you for 167 every 2 sec for 8 sec.\n\nPurification Protocol deals 50% additional damage against Aberrations."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299345] = "Call down a purifying beam upon the target area, dealing 1,819 Fire damage over 6 sec. Has a low chance to immediately annihilate any specimen deemed unworthy by MOTHER.\n\nAny Aberration struck by the beam is stunned for 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299346] = "MOTHER has added a Purification Protocol to your Heart of Azeroth, allowing your damaging spells and abilities to release a blast of Azerite energy at your target, dealing 462 Fire damage to any enemy within 8 yds, and heals you for 167 every 2 sec for 8 sec.\n\nPurification Protocol deals 50% additional damage against Aberrations."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299347] = "Call down a purifying beam upon the target area, dealing 1,819 Fire damage over 6 sec. Has a low chance to immediately annihilate any specimen deemed unworthy by MOTHER.\n\nWhen an enemy dies within the beam, your damage is increased by 10% for 8 sec.\n\nAny Aberration struck by the beam is stunned for 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299348] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to cauterize your target for 863 Fire damage over 10 sec or to heal an ally for 863 over 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299349] = "Blast your target with a ball of concentrated flame, dealing 325 Fire damage to an enemy or healing an ally for 325, then burn the target for an additional 75% of the damage or healing done over 6 sec.\n\nEach cast of Concentrated Flame deals 100% increased damage or healing. This bonus resets after every third cast."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299350] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to cauterize your target for 863 Fire damage over 10 sec or to heal an ally for 863 over 10 sec, stacking up to 3 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299353] = "Blast your target with a ball of concentrated flame, dealing 325 Fire damage to an enemy or healing an ally for 325, then burn the target for an additional 75% of the damage or healing done over 6 sec.\n\nEach cast of Concentrated Flame deals 100% increased damage or healing. This bonus resets after every third cast.\nMax 2 Charges."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299354] = "Your spells and abilities have a high chance to impale your target with a spike of Azerite, causing 542 Fire damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299355] = "Call upon Azeroth to summon a Guardian of Azeroth for 30 sec who impales your target with spikes of Azerite every 2.5 sec that deal 542 Fire damage. Every 8 sec, the Guardian launches a volley of Azerite Spikes at its target, dealing 440 Fire damage to all nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299357] = "Your spells and abilities have a high chance to impale your target with a spike of Azerite, causing 542 Fire damage.\n\nWhen an Azerite spike deals damage, all damage you deal against that target is increased by 3% for 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299358] = "Call upon Azeroth to summon a Guardian of Azeroth for 30 sec who impales your target with spikes of Azerite every 2.5 sec that deal 542 Fire damage. Every 8 sec, the Guardian launches a volley of Azerite Spikes at its target, dealing 440 Fire damage to all nearby enemies.\n\nEach time the Guardian of Azeroth casts a spell, you gain 2% Haste, stacking up to 5 times. This effect ends when the Guardian of Azeroth despawns."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299367] = "Reduces the cooldown of Arcane Power by 10.0%.\n\nWhen you activate Arcane Power, immediately heal for 5% of maximum health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299368] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to activate Arcane Power for 35% of its base duration."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299369] = "Reduces the cooldown of Arcane Power by 10.0%, and increases your Versatility by 7.\n\nWhen you activate Arcane Power, immediately heal for 5% of maximum health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299370] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to activate Arcane Power for 35% of its base duration.\n\nWhen the Vision of Perfection activates, you and up to 2 other nearby allies gain 9 Haste for 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299371] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to refund 50% of the Mana spent on them and heal you for 753."
