WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299375] = "When an ability fails to critically strike, you have a high chance to gain Reckless Force. When Reckless Force reaches 20 stacks, your critical strike is increased by 70% for 4 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299376] = "Unleash the forces within the Heart of Azeroth, causing shards of Azerite to strike your target for 823 Fire damage over 2 sec. This damage is increased by 300% if it critically strikes."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299377] = "When an ability fails to critically strike, you have a high chance to gain Reckless Force. When Reckless Force reaches 20 stacks, your critical strike is increased by 70% for 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[299378] = "Unleash the forces within the Heart of Azeroth, causing shards of Azerite to strike your target for 823 Fire damage over 2 sec. This damage is increased by 300% if it critically strikes.\n\nEach time The Unbound Force causes a critical strike, it immediately strikes the target with an additional Azerite shard, up to a maximum of 5."
