WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[305394] = "Blessing of Freedom increases movement speed by 30%, and you gain Blessing of Freedom when cast on a friendly target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[305483] = "Grips the target in lightning, stunning and dealing 14,630 Nature damage over 5 sec while the target is lassoed. Can move while channeling."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[306396] = "The Lightspawn blesses you, granting you a 60% speed boost for 10 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[306830] = "Place a Kyrian Sigil at the target location that activates after 2 sec.\n\nDetonates to deal 132 Arcane damage and shatter up to 3 Lesser Soul Fragments from enemies affected by the sigil. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[307337] = "Bind Nadjia the Mistblade's soul to yours."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[307443] = "Conjure a radiant spark that causes 384 Arcane damage instantly, and an additional 233 damage over 10 sec.\n\nThe target takes 10% increased damage from your direct damage spells, stacking each time they are struck. This effect ends after 4 spells."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[307865] = "Throw a Kyrian spear at the target location, dealing 38 Arcane damage instantly and an additional 47 damage over 4 sec. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets.\n\nEnemies hit are tethered to Spear of Bastion's location for the duration.\n\nGenerates 25 Rage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[308491] = "Fire a resonating arrow to the target location that deals 7 Arcane damage to any enemy in the area, and fill the area with echoing anima for 10 sec. The effect causes your attacks to ignore line of sight to enemies in the area, and you have 30% increased critical strike chance against them. \n\nLeaving the area of echoing anima will still allow the hunter to ignore line of sight towards the enemy for 4 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[309328] = "Transforms the enemy into a living honey for 1 min. While hexed, the victim is incapacitated, and cannot attack or cast spells. Damage may cancel the effect. Limit 1. Only works on Humanoids and Beasts."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[309452] = "Collect the appearances of the Vestments of the Eternal Traveler armor set."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310143] = "Turn into a Vulpin, teleporting 15 yds forward and increasing your movement speed by 50%. You may reactivate Soulshape every few sec to teleport again.\n\nLasts 12 sec, or indefinitely while in a rest area."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310160] = "Unlocks the Abyssal Focus, required to craft the best equipment from resources gathered in Nazjatar."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310422] = "Every 10 sec, allies within 15 yds gain a shield that absorbs 74 damage, stacking up to 669.\n\nUnique:  Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310425] = "Release 12 protective spheres outward over 3.6 sec, granting the first ally to touch it a barrier that absorbs 1209.7 damage for 10 sec.\n\nEach time you send out a protective sphere, gain an absorb shield for 2% of your maximum health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310426] = "Every 10 sec, allies within 15 yds gain a shield that absorbs 74 damage, stacking up to 669.\n\nTargets protected by Unwavering Ward take 3% reduced damage.\n\nUnique:  Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310442] = "Release 12 protective spheres outward over 3.6 sec, granting the first ally to touch it a barrier that absorbs 1209.7 damage for 10 sec.\n\nEach time you send out a protective sphere, gain an absorb shield for 2% of your maximum health.\n\nWhen an ally gains the absorb shield, you and that ally heal for 228."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310454] = "For the next 30 sec, your Mastery is increased by 9%. Additionally,"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310592] = "Taunt all nearby enemies, forcing them to attack you for 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310601] = "Taunt all nearby enemies, forcing them to attack you for 6 sec, and increase your dodge chance by 15% for 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310602] = "Taunt all nearby enemies, forcing them to attack you for 6 sec, and increase your dodge chance by 15% for 6 sec.\n\nTargets affected by your Vigilant Protector take 50% additional damage from you."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310603] = "Every 2 sec, store 123 healing, up to a maximum of 3,055. When you dodge or parry an attack, heal for all stored healing. \n\nUnique:  Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310607] = "Every 2 sec, store 130 healing, up to a maximum of 3,055. When you dodge or parry an attack, heal for all stored healing.\n\nUnique:  Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310608] = "Every 2 sec, store 130 healing, up to a maximum of 3,055. When you dodge or parry an attack, heal for all stored healing.\n\nThe maximum health of all Tank specialization players in your party or raid is increased by 3%, stacking.\n\nUnique:  Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310690] = "Burn your target with a bolt of Azerite, dealing 2,016 Fire damage. If the target has less than 20% health, the cooldown is reduced by 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[310712] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to strike your target for 818 Fire damage.\n\nUnique:  Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311194] = "Burn your target with a bolt of Azerite, dealing 2,016 Fire damage. If the target has less than 20% health or more than 80% health, the cooldown is reduced by 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311195] = "Burn your target with a bolt of Azerite, dealing 2,016 Fire damage. If the target has less than 20% health or more than 80% health, the cooldown is reduced by 30 sec.\n\nIf Reaping Flames kills an enemy, its cooldown is lowered to 5 sec and it will deal 100% increased damage on its next use."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311197] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to strike your target for 818 Fire damage, and heal you for 50% of the damage dealt.\n\nUnique:  Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311198] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to strike your target for 818 Fire damage, and heal you for 50% of the damage dealt.\n\nIf your target is below 20% health, the chance for extra damage is increased by 400%.\n\nUnique:  Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311203] = "Release a wave of energy from your Heart of Azeroth, increasing the damage all party members within 15 yds deal with Azerite Essences by 45% for the next 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311210] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to increase your Haste by 11 for 8 sec and reduce the cooldown of your currently slotted Major Essence by 1.0 sec.\n\nUnique:  Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311302] = "Release a wave of energy from your Heart of Azeroth, increasing the damage all party members within 15 yds deal with Azerite Essences by 45% for the next 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311303] = "Release a wave of energy from your Heart of Azeroth, increasing the damage all party members within 15 yds deal with Azerite Essences by 45% and their Speed by 25 for the next 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311304] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to increase you and 1 other ally's Haste by 11 for 8 sec and reduce the cooldown of you and 1 other ally's currently slotted Major Essence by 1.0 sec.\n\nUnique:  Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311306] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to increase you and 2 other allies' Haste by 11 for 8 sec and reduce the cooldown of you and 2 other allies' currently slotted Major Essence by 1.0 sec.\n\nUnique:  Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311648] = "A heavy mist surrounds you for 8 sec, increasing your Dodge by 10%. \n\nDeals 7 Shadow damage every 1 sec to enemies within 10 yds. Every time it deals damage you gain 3 Runic Power, up to a maximum of 15 Runic Power. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[311724] = "Grants the title \"Veteran of the Fourth War\"."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312173] = "You can now find Atonement Crypt Keys in the Halls of Atonement."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312198] = "Reduces Fire damage taken by 1%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312202] = "Admonish your target for their past transgressions, reducing the damage they deal to you by 8% and dealing 82 Arcane damage over 14 sec.\n\nWhile Shackle the Unworthy is active on an enemy, your direct-damage attacks that spend runes have a 100% chance to spread Shackle the Unworthy to a nearby enemy."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312215] = "When you first take damage from an enemy, reduce that damage by 5% of your maximum health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312321] = "Deal 242 Arcane damage instantly, and 459 over 18 sec. If the enemy dies while affected by Scouring Tithe, you generate 5 Soul Shards. If they survive, Scouring Tithe's cooldown is refreshed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312370] = "Make a camp at this location. Can only be used outdoors."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312372] = "Return to your camp."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312411] = "Pull your chosen trick from the bag and use it on target enemy or ally. Enemies take 958 damage and are snared by 80% for 4 sec, while allies are healed for 1,436 and move 20% faster for 4 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312425] = "Change the contents of your Bag of Tricks. Now where did you put that...?"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312427] = "You are now able to participate in venthyr rituals at the Halls of Atonement."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312725] = "Replicate the energy in your target's Heart of Azeroth, gaining access to rank 1 of their currently slotted Major Essence for the next 15 sec. The Formless Void will go on cooldown for 50% longer than the base cooldown of the Essence you replicated.\n\nDoes not work on passive Essences."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312766] = "Common\nGnomish"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312769] = "Common\nGnomish"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312771] = "Each time any ally within 40 yds uses an Azerite Essence, gain 8 Intellect for 20 sec.\n\nUnique: Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312890] = "Allows opening of locked chests and doors that require a skill level of up to 70."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312896] = "You function as a personal Blacksmithing Anvil, Cooking Fire, and Mining Forge. In addition, your limbs include every profession tool."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312916] = "When you fall below 20% health, heal for 15% of your maximum health. This effect cannot occur more than once every 2.5 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312923] = "You gather and analyze combat data every 5 sec, increasing your primary stat by 1, stacking up to 10 times. The data decays while out of combat."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312924] = "Summon Organic Light duplicates to distract your foes for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312940] = "Admonish your target for their past transgressions, reducing the damage they deal to you by 8% and dealing 82 Arcane damage over 14 sec.\n\nWhile Shackle the Unworthy is active on an enemy, your direct-damage attacks that spend runes have a 100% chance to spread Shackle the Unworthy to a nearby enemy."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312941] = "Place a Kyrian Sigil at the target location that activates after 2 sec.\n\nDetonates to deal 131 Arcane damage and shatter up to 3 Lesser Soul Fragments from enemies affected by the sigil. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312946] = "Form a bond with an ally. Every 1 min, you may empower the bond for 10 sec, granting you an effect based on your partner's role, and granting them an effect based on your role.\n\nDamager\n Kindred Empowerment\nEnergize your bonded partner, granting them 20% of your damage as additional Arcane damage, healing, or absorption."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312947] = "Fire a resonating arrow to the target location that deals 7 Arcane damage to any enemy in the area, and fill the area with echoing anima for 10 sec. The effect causes your attacks to ignore line of sight to enemies in the area, and you have 30% increased critical strike chance against them. \n\nLeaving the area of echoing anima will still allow the hunter to ignore line of sight towards the enemy for 4 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312950] = "Conjure a radiant spark that causes 384 Arcane damage instantly, and an additional 233 damage over 10 sec.\n\nThe target takes 10% increased damage from your direct damage spells, stacking each time they are struck. This effect ends after 4 spells."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312951] = "For the next 30 sec, your Mastery is increased by 9%. Additionally,"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312952] = "Instantly cast Holy Shock, Avenger's Shield, or Judgment on up to 5 targets within 30 yds (based on your current specialization)."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312953] = "Draw upon the power of the Ascended for 10 sec, granting you access to Ascended Nova, replacing Smite with Ascended Blast, and increasing movement speed by 50%.\n\nUpon expiration, releases an Ascended Eruption:\n\nExplode for up to 805 Arcane damage to enemies and 589 healing to allies within 15 yds, based on number of targets. Damage and healing increased by 3% for each stack of Boon of the Ascended."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312954] = "Deal 42 Arcane damage to an enemy, extracting their anima to Animacharge a combo point for 45 sec.\n\nDamaging finishing moves that consume the same number of combo points as your Animacharge function as if they consumed 7 combo points.\n\nAwards 2 combo points."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312955] = "Summon a totem at the target location for 30 sec. Your next 3 damage spells or abilities will cause the totem to radiate 305 Arcane damage to up to 6 enemies near the totem, and your next 3 healing spells will heal up to 6 allies near the totem for 351 health.\n\nCasting this ability again while the totem is active will relocate the totem."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312956] = "Deal 249 Arcane damage instantly, and 459 over 18 sec. If the enemy dies while affected by Scouring Tithe, you generate 5 Soul Shards. If they survive, Scouring Tithe's cooldown is refreshed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[312957] = "Throw a Kyrian spear at the target location, dealing 38 Arcane damage instantly and an additional 47 damage over 4 sec. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets.\n\nEnemies hit are tethered to Spear of Bastion's location for the duration.\n\nGenerates 25 Rage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[313601] = "Collect the Heritage of Gilneas appearances."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[313605] = "Collect the Heritage of Kezan  appearances."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[313919] = "Each time any ally within 40 yds uses an Azerite Essence, gain 11 Intellect for 20 sec.\n\nUnique: Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[313920] = "Each time any ally within 40 yds uses an Azerite Essence, gain 11 Intellect and 7 Haste for 20 sec.\n\nThe ally who used an Azerite Essence also gains 7 Haste for 20 sec. Only one ally can have this Haste effect at a time.\n\nUnique: Corruption Resistance increased by 10."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[313921] = "Replicate the energy in your target's Heart of Azeroth, gaining access to rank 2 of their currently slotted Major Essence for the next 15 sec. The Formless Void will go on cooldown for 40% longer than the base cooldown of the Essence you replicated.\n\nDoes not work on passive Essences."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[313922] = "Replicate the energy in your target's Heart of Azeroth, gaining access to rank 3 of their currently slotted Major Essence for the next 15 sec. The Formless Void will go on cooldown for 30% longer than the base cooldown of the Essence you replicated.\n\nDoes not work on passive Essences."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[314068] = "Collect the appearances of the Heritage of the Mechagnome."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[314069] = "Collect the appearances of the Heritage of the Vulpera."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[314109] = "Upgrades the Void Focus to the Empowered Void Focus, allowing you to craft better equipment using resources gathered from N'Zoth's followers."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[314110] = "Upgrades the Empowered Void Focus to the Dreadful Void Focus, allowing you to craft the best equipment using resources gathered from N'Zoth's followers."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[314215] = "Manapoof can now teleport you to Blackrock Depths."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[314791] = "Draw power from the ground beneath, dealing 1,037 Nature damage over 3.6 sec to enemies within 18 yds. \n\nWhile channeling, your Mage ability cooldowns are reduced by 10 sec over 3.6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[314793] = "Conjure 3 mirrors to torment the enemy for 25 sec. Whenever the target attacks, casts a spell, or uses an ability, a mirror is consumed to inflict 252 Shadow damage and their movement and cast speed are slowed by 15%. This effect cannot be triggered more often than once per 6 sec.\n\nThe final mirror will instead inflict 638 Shadow damage to the enemy, Rooting and Silencing them for 4 sec.\n\nWhenever a mirror is consumed you gain Clearcasting."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315341] = "Finishing move that blasts your target with your pistol, dealing Physical damage and increasing your damage dealt by 4%. Multiple instances of this bonus can overlap.\n   1 point : 19 damage, 4 sec\n   2 points: 37 damage, 6 sec\n   3 points: 56 damage, 8 sec\n   4 points: 75 damage, 10 sec\n   5 points: 94 damage, 12 sec"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315442] = "Learn Death's Due, replacing Death and Decay."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315443] = "Sprout an additional limb, dealing 131 Shadow damage over 12 sec to all nearby enemies. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets. Every 1 sec, an enemy is pulled to your location if they are further than 8 yds from you. The same enemy can only be pulled once every 4 sec.\n\nGain  instantly, and again every 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315496] = "Finishing move that consumes combo points to increase attack speed by 50%. Lasts longer per combo point.\n   1 point  : 12 seconds\n   2 points: 18 seconds\n   3 points: 24 seconds\n   4 points: 30 seconds\n   5 points: 36 seconds"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315508] = "Roll the dice of fate, providing a random combat enhancement for 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315584] = "Coats your weapons with a Lethal Poison that lasts for 1 hour. Each strike has a 30% chance of poisoning the enemy which instantly inflicts 2 Nature damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315720] = "Brutally attack an enemy for 144 Physical damage.\n\nGenerates 30 Rage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315793] = "While in Ny'alotha, your spells and abilities have a chance to draw an orb of Vita and Void towards you. Collecting the orb increases your Intellect by 292 for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315863] = "Provides access to new talents, available while exploring Horrific Visions."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315864] = "Provides access to Horrific Visions, the darkest manifestations of N'Zoth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315867] = "Judgment generates 1 Holy Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315921] = "When you cast Word of Glory on yourself, it is increased by up to 300% based on your missing health and 100% of the mana cost is refunded."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[315924] = "When you cast Word of Glory on someone other than yourself, its healing is increased by up to 100% based on the target's missing health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[316239] = "Strike the target for 21 Physical damage. This attack cannot be dodged, blocked, or parried."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[316402] = "Execute no longer costs Rage and now generates 20 Rage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[316405] = "Execute no longer has a cooldown and if your foe survives, 10% of the Rage spent is refunded."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[316440] = "Overpower and Slam increase the damage of your next Mortal Strike by 5%, stacking up to 3 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[316803] = "Increases Frost Strike and Glacial Advance damage by 10%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[316838] = "Increases Howling Blast damage done by an additional 75%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[316958] = "Hallow the target area for 30 sec. Enemies in the area suffer up to 3,481 Shadow damage, and allies are healed for up to 2,255, reduced if there are more than 5 targets.\n\nWithin the Hallow, you may use Hammer of Wrath on any target, and its damage is increased by 100%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317009] = "Brand an enemy with the mark of the Venthyr, reducing their melee attack speed by 30%, their casting speed by 30%, and inflicting 132 Shadow damage over 8 sec.\n\nActivating Metamorphosis applies Sinful Brand to all nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317073] = "Attempts to finish off a foe, causing up to 170 Physical damage based on Rage spent. Only usable on enemies that have less than 20% health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317099] = "Coats your weapons with a Lethal Poison that lasts for 1 hour. Each strike has a 30% chance of poisoning the enemy which instantly inflicts 2 Nature damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317130] = "Grants immunity to all damage and harmful effects for 8 sec. \n\nCannot be used if you have Forbearance. Causes Forbearance for 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317131] = "Grants immunity to all damage, harmful effects, knockbacks and forced movement effects for 8 sec. \n\nCannot be used if you have Forbearance. Causes Forbearance for 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317133] = "Vampiric Blood's healing and absorb amount is increased by 5% and duration by 2 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317138] = "Unending Resolve reduces damage taken by an additional 15%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317198] = "Increases the damage of Obliterate by 10% and the damage of Frostscythe by 8%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317214] = "Killing Machine also causes your next Obliterate to deal Frost damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317320] = "Learn Condemn, replacing Execute. Condemn deals Shadow damage, can be used on enemies who are above 80% health or below 20% health, and weakens the target preventing some of the damage they would deal to you."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317429] = "Brings a dead ally back to life with 35% health and mana. Cannot be cast when in combat."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317464] = "Opens a gate which you can use to return to Ebon Hold.\n\nUsing a Death Gate while in Ebon Hold will return you back to near your departure point."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317610] = "While Crimson Scourge is active, your next Death and Decay heals you for 13 health per Bone Shield charge and you immediately gain 10 Runic Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317647] = "Cleanses a corrupted item, permanently removing its corruption effects."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317697] = "Summons a Voidwalker under your command, able to withstand heavy punishment."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317706] = "Turn into a Ghost Wolf, increasing movement speed by 30% and preventing movement speed from being reduced below 100%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317795] = "Increases the size of your backpack by 8 slots."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317872] = "Cooldown reduced by 60 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317906] = "Duration increased by 4 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317907] = "You may now also block spells and harmful periodic effects."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[317911] = "Cooldown reduced by 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[318038] = "Imbue your weapon with the element of Fire for 1 hour, increasing the damage of your Fire spells by 5.0%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[318044] = "Reduces the cast time of Lightning Bolt by 0.5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319066] = "Wound Poison can now stack 2 additional times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319158] = "Heals for an additional 10% of maximum health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319175] = "Finishing move that launches explosive Black Powder at all nearby enemies dealing Physical damage. Deals reduced damage beyond 8 targets.\n\n   1 point  : 6 damage\n   2 points: 13 damage\n   3 points: 20 damage\n   4 points: 26 damage\n   5 points: 33 damage"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319191] = "Shifting Power puts flowers at your feet for 12.0 sec that increase your Haste by 15% while you stand with them."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319210] = "When at least 2 allies are within 8 yd, your Versatility increases by 3% for 5 sec. When this expires, 2 nearby allies gain 33% of this effect for 5 sec before passing it back to you."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319211] = "When your roots, stuns, and incapacitating class effects expire or are dispelled, your target's movement speed is reduced by 90%, decaying rapidly over 2 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319213] = "10% of your overhealing received or done remains as a shield on the target up to 10% of the caster's health, lasting for 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319214] = "When falling farther than 20 yd, faerie dust slows your fall for the next 30 sec. This cannot occur more often than once per 1 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319216] = "After spending 60 sec in a rested area, you gain 20% increased movement speed for 30 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319217] = "When you take damage that would kill you, instead rejuvenate within a wildseed, regaining 30% of HP over 10 sec. If the wildseed takes more than 3,800 damage during this time, you die.\n\nThis effect may only occur once every 10 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319230] = "Apocalypse creates an unholy pact that forms shadowy chains between you and your ghoul, dealing 79 Shadow damage over 15 sec to enemies caught in between."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319439] = "When you use 3 different combo point-generating abilities within 4 sec, the damage of your next 3 Rips or Ferocious Bites is increased by 25% for their full duration."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319473] = "Mastery: Potent Assassin also increases damage of your bleeds."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319836] = "Blasts the enemy for 347 Fire damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319930] = "Stormstrike has an additional charge.\n\nStormsurge now also causes your next Stormstrike to deal 25% additional damage as Nature damage, stacking up to 2 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319949] = "Backstab has 15% increased critical strike chance.\n\nWhile behind your target, Backstab critical strikes grant Find Weakness for 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319951] = "Shuriken Storm has 15% increased critical strike chance.\n\nShuriken Storm critical strikes grant Find Weakness for 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319973] = "While you are above 80% health you gain 1% Intellect every 2 sec, stacking up to 5 times. If you fall below 50% health, this effect is lost."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319978] = "Door of Shadows grants you a shield that absorbs damage equal to 20% of your maximum health. Lasts 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319982] = "When a nearby ally gains temporary increased movement speed, you also gain the benefit, up to 30% for 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[319983] = "Mirrors of Torment signals the start of tea time, granting 6% Versatility to you and 3% Versatility to up to 4 nearby allies. Lasts 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320313] = "Consume Magic generates 20 Fury when a beneficial Magic effect is successfully removed from the target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320331] = "Immolation Aura increases your armor by 20% and causes melee attackers to suffer 4 Fire damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320361] = "Increases the range of Disrupt to 10 yds."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320364] = "Immolation Aura instantly causes 11 Fire damage to enemies within 8 yards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320374] = "Immolation Aura generates an additional 18 Fury over 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320377] = "Increases the duration of Immolation Aura by 4 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320378] = "Reduces the cooldown of Immolation Aura by 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320379] = "Reduces the cooldown of Spectral Sight by 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320380] = "Fel energy thickens your skin to demonic proportions, increasing your Stamina by 55% and your Armor by 190%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320386] = "Throw Glaive ricochets to 1 additional target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320387] = "Reduces the cooldown of Fracture by 1 sec and Throw Glaive by 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320402] = "Reduces the cooldown of Blade Dance by 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320412] = "Each enemy stunned by Chaos Nova has a 30% chance to generate a Lesser Soul Fragment."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320413] = "The chance that Chaos Strike will refund 20 Fury is increased by 30% of your critical strike chance."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320416] = "Shift gains an additional charge."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320418] = "Reduces the cooldown of Sigil of Misery by 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320577] = "Stonehead will let you freely pass through the Ember Ward gate."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320635] = "Vengeful Retreat reduces the movement speed of all nearby enemies by 70% for 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320639] = "Fel Devastation damage also heals you for up to 60 health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320654] = "Mastery increases your movement speed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320658] = "Soulshape's cooldown is reduced by 15 sec, and defeating an enemy reduces Soulshape's cooldown by 1 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320659] = "Your damaging attacks and spells have a chance to toss Niya's Spiked Burrs under your target. The burrs latch onto the first enemy to cross them, reducing movement speed by 20% and inflicting 755 Nature damage over 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320660] = "Your interrupts apply Niya's Paralytic Poison to your target, dealing 570 Nature damage over 30 sec. Targets with Niya's Paralytic Poison take an additional 91 Nature damage if interrupted once more."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320662] = "Your healing spells and abilities have a chance to apply Niya's Invigorating Herbs, increasing the target's Haste by 5% for 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320668] = "You have a chance to obtain leather, meat, and fish when you kill an enemy that yields experience or honor."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320674] = "Send a wave of anima at the target, which then jumps to additional nearby targets. Deals 773 Shadow damage to up to 5 enemies, and restores 1,194 health to up to 5 allies.\n\nFor each target critically struck, the cooldown of Chain Harvest is reduced by 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320687] = "Movement speed increased by 20% for 2 min after defeating an enemy. Combat cancels this effect."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320747] = "Consume up to 3 charges of Earth Shield to heal up to 3 allies near your Earth Shield target for 309 per charge consumed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320770] = "Increases maximum Fury by 20."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320794] = "Sigil of Flame deals an additional 70 Fire damage over 8 sec, to all enemies affected by the sigil."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320813] = "Shields you with fire, absorbing 760 Fire damage for 30 sec.\n\nOnly one ward may be active at a time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320853] = "Wend through the shadows, appearing at the targeted location."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320863] = "You exploit the enemy target's weakest point, instantly dealing damage equal to 100% of your maximum health to them.\n\nOnly usable on creatures that have less health than you."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320962] = "Fiery Brand deals 0 Fire damage every 1 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[320976] = "You attempt to finish off a wounded target, dealing 139 Physical damage. Only usable on enemies with less than 20% health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321014] = "Barbed Shot now instantly grants 25 Focus.\n\nPassive Focus generation increased by 75%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321018] = "Steady Shot now generates an additional 10 Focus."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321028] = "Demon Spikes also increases your Parry chance by 8% for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321047] = "Shapeshift into a travel form appropriate to your current location, increasing movement speed on land, in water, or in the air, and granting protection from Polymorph effects.\n\nThe act of shapeshifting frees you from movement impairing effects."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321067] = "While transformed, Shear and Fracture generate 0 additional Lesser Soul Fragment."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321068] = "While transformed, Shear and Fracture generate 15 additional Fury."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321117] = "Transforms the enemy into a sheep, wandering around incapacitated for 1 min. While affected, the victim cannot take actions but will regenerate health very quickly. Damage may cancel the effect. Limit 1.\n\nOnly works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321136] = "Every 3 Shields of the Righteous make your next Word of Glory cost no Holy Power. Maximum 2 stacks."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321159] = "Hurls a frost trap to the target location that incapacitates the first enemy that approaches for 1 min. Damage may break the effect. Limit 1. Trap will exist for 1 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321186] = "Summons your second pet to you."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321287] = "Arcane Shot and Multi-Shot damage increased by 25%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321290] = "Wildfire Bomb deals 6% additional damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321291] = "If a target dies within 7 sec after being struck by Shadow Word: Death, generate 8 Insanity.\n\nWhen Shadow Word: Death fails to kill a target below 20% health, its cooldown is reset. Cannot occur more than once every 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321293] = "Arcane Shot and Chimaera Shot Focus cost reduced by 20."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321297] = "Take direct control of your pet and see through its eyes for 1 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321299] = "Mastery increases your Attack Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321377] = "Holy Word: Sanctify reduces the cast time and cost of your Prayer of Healing by 20% for 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321387] = "Arcane damage dealt is increased based on your current mana, up to 6% at full mana.\n\nMana Regen is increased based on your current mana, up to 20% when out of mana."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321395] = "Transforms the enemy into a mawrat, wandering around incapacitated for 1 min. While affected, the victim cannot take actions but will regenerate health very quickly. Damage will cancel the effect. Limit 1.\n\nOnly works on Undead, Beasts, Humanoids and Critters."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321420] = "Clearcasting can stack up to 2 additional times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321460] = "Kill Shot now has 2 charges and has its cooldown reduced by 2.0 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321468] = "Targets stunned by Binding Shot, knocked back by High Explosive Trap, knocked up by Implosive Trap, incapacitated by Scatter Shot, or stunned by Intimidation deal 10% less damage to you for 8 sec after the effect ends."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321507] = "Applies Touch of the Magi to your current target, accumulating 20% of the damage you deal to the target for 12 sec, and then exploding for that amount of Arcane damage to the target and reduced damage to all nearby enemies.\n\nGenerates 4 Arcane Charges."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321526] = "Arcane Barrage grants you 2.0% of your maximum mana per Arcane Charge spent."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321530] = "Bestial Wrath provokes your pets to tear into your target, causing your target to bleed for 42 damage over 12 sec.\n\nDamage from Bloodshed has a 10% chance to summon Dire Beasts."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321687] = "Form a shield of flesh and bone over 3 sec that absorbs damage equal to 40% of your maximum health for 2 min.\n\nWhile channeling, your damage taken is reduced by 20%.\n\nPassive: Moving near an enemy's corpse consumes their essence to reduce Fleshcraft's cooldown by 1 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321708] = "Blazing Barrier gains an additional charge and cauterizes your wounds, healing you for 15% of the damage it absorbs."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321711] = "Deals an additional 87 Fire damage over 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321739] = "Arcane Surge lasts an additional 3 sec and grants 25% increased Spell Damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321745] = "Prismatic Barrier gains an additional charge and further reduces magic damage taken by 5%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321752] = "Increases Arcane Explosion and Arcane Blast damage by 5%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[321792] = "Call forth a cloud of chaotic anima that travels to the target enemy, dealing 97 Shadow damage to enemies in its path. When the anima reaches the target it explodes, inflicting either Curse of Weakness or Curse of Tongues, and dealing 674 Shadow damage over 12 sec to all nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322101] = "Expel negative chi from your body, healing for 458 and dealing 10% of the amount healed as Nature damage to an enemy within 20 yards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322102] = "Cooldown is reduced by  10 sec. and draws in the positive chi of all your Healing Spheres to increase the healing done by Expel Harm."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322109] = "You exploit the enemy target's weakest point, instantly dealing damage equal to 100% of your maximum health to them.\n\nOnly usable on creatures that have less health than you."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322113] = "Touch of Death can now be used on targets with less than 15% health remaining, dealing 35% of your maximum health in damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322115] = "Power Word: Radiance gains an additional charge."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322118] = "Summons an effigy of Yu'lon, the Jade Serpent for 25 sec. Yu'lon will heal injured allies with Soothing Breath, healing the target and up to 2 allies for 797 over 4.0 sec. \n\nEnveloping Mist costs 50% less mana while Yu'lon is active."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322120] = "Niuzao's teachings allow you to shuffle during combat, increasing the effectiveness of your Stagger by 100%.\n\nShuffle is granted by attacking enemies with your Keg Smash, Blackout Kick, and Spinning Crane Kick.\n\n Stagger: You shrug off attacks, delaying a portion of Physical damage based on your Agility, instead taking it over 10 sec. Affects magical attacks at 58% effectiveness."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322507] = "A swig of strong brew that coalesces purified chi escaping your body into a celestial guard, absorbing 2,381 damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322510] = "Purifying Brew increases the absorption of your next Celestial Brew by up to 200%, based on Stagger purified."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322719] = "When you kill an enemy with Blackout Kick, you have a 50% chance to summon a Chi Sphere, granting 1 Chi when you walk through it."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322721] = "Healing or dealing damage has a chance to grant you a stack of Redirected Anima. Redirected Anima increases your maximum health by 1% and your Mastery by 6 for 30 sec, and stacks overlap.\n\nShifting Power grants you 6 stacks of Redirected Anima."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322729] = "Spin while kicking in the air, dealing 14 Physical damage over 1.3 sec to enemies within 8 yds."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322740] = "While active, Invoke Niuzao, the Black Ox can be recast to cause Niuzao to stomp mightily and knock nearby enemies into the air."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[322960] = "Fortifying Brew increases Stagger effectiveness by 15% while active.\n\nCombines with other Fortifying Brew effects."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323074] = "Fleshcraft's passive effect consumes a corpse's essence completely, granting a benefit based on the creature's type. \n\nCasting Fleshcraft also consumes a small portion of your own essence, granting you the Humanoid benefit."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323079] = "Allows opening of locks that require up to 60 skill, once every 12 hours.\n\nEach 1 sec spent channeling Fleshcraft reduces Kevin's Keyring's cooldown by 60 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323081] = "Defeating enemies has a chance to deploy your Plagueborn Cleansing Slime, which improves the remaining durability on your armor."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323089] = "While standing still, you slowly build stacks of Bloop's Wanderlust. At 5 stacks, your movement speed is increased by 10% for 2 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323090] = "Your first attack or spell cast on an enemy increases your damage done to them by 12% for 15 sec. Limit 1."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323091] = "When reduced below 50% health, Ooz courses over you, granting you a shield for 15% of your maximum health for 10 sec. May only occur once per 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323095] = "While channeling Fleshcraft, you are immune to crowd control and you regenerate 2% health every 1 sec. \n\nIf you finish the full channel, you gain 3 sec of crowd control immunity, during which you regenerate 2% health every 1 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323546] = "For 20 sec, Druid spells you cast increase your damage and healing by 2%, and haste by 1%, stacking.\n\nIf you spend 2 sec idle, the Frenzy overcomes you, consuming 1% of your health per stack, stunning you for 1 sec, and ending."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323547] = "Deal 42 Arcane damage to an enemy, extracting their anima to Animacharge a combo point for 45 sec.\n\nDamaging finishing moves that consume the same number of combo points as your Animacharge function as if they consumed 7 combo points.\n\nAwards 2 combo points."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323639] = "Charge to your target, striking them for 156 Nature damage, rooting them in place for 1.5 sec and inflicting 115 Nature damage over 6 sec to up to 5 enemies in your path. \n\nThe pursuit invigorates your soul, healing you for 25% of the damage you deal to your Hunt target for 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323654] = "Lash the target for 17 Shadow damage, causing each combo point spent within 12 sec to lash for an additional 3. Dealing damage with Flagellation increases your Haste by 1%, persisting 12 sec after their torment fades."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323673] = "Assault an enemy's mind, dealing 1,129 Shadow damage and briefly reversing their perception of reality.\n\nFor 5 sec, the next 1,710 damage they deal will heal their target, and the next 1,710 healing they deal will damage their target.\n\nReversed damage and healing restore up to 4% mana."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323764] = "Call upon the Night Fae for an eruption of energy, channeling a rapid flurry of 16 Druid spells and abilities over 4 sec.\n\nYou will cast Wild Growth, Swiftmend, Moonfire, Wrath, Regrowth, Rejuvenation, Rake, and Thrash on appropriate nearby targets, favoring your current shapeshift form."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323916] = "When reduced below 20% health, you fear nearby enemies for 3.5 sec. May only occur once per 60 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323918] = "Movement speed increased by 3% for every nearby enemy, up to 15%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323919] = "Gain 3% Haste for 10 sec after defeating an enemy, up to 15%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323921] = "Fleshcraft increases your maximum health by 5% for 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[323999] = "Xuen strikes your enemies with Empowered Tiger Lightning every 4 sec, dealing 4% of the damage you and your summons have dealt to those targets in the last 4 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324128] = "Corrupts the targeted ground, causing 21 Shadow damage over 10 sec to targets within the area.\n\nDeath's Due reduces damage enemies deal to you by 2%, up to a maximum of 8% and their power is transferred to you as an equal amount of Strength."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324143] = "Brandish the Conqueror's Banner, granting 346 Mastery and 30% increased movement speed to you and your 2 nearest allies, and preventing movement speed from being reduced below 100%. Lasts 15 sec.\n\nGenerates 4 Rage per sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324149] = "Fire a shot at your enemy, dealing 17 Shadow damage and then causing them to bleed for 44 Shadow damage over 18 sec. Each time Flayed Shot deals damage, you have a 15% chance to gain Flayer's Mark, causing your next Kill Shot to be free, usable on any target regardless of their current health, and deal 25% increased damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324220] = "Transform into a powerful skeletal mage for 25 sec. \n\nWhile in the form of a skeletal mage, your Frostbolt, Fireball, and Arcane Blast hit up to 2 enemies near your target and your spell damage is increased by 15%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324312] = "You and the target charge each other, meeting halfway then rooting all targets within 6 yards for 4 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324386] = "Summon a totem at the target location for 30 sec. Your next 3 damage spells or abilities will cause the totem to radiate 305 Arcane damage to up to 6 enemies near the totem, and your next 3 healing spells will heal up to 6 allies near the totem for 353 health.\n\nCasting this ability again while the totem is active will relocate the totem."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324440] = "After taking falling damage, the health lost becomes a shield lasting 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324441] = "You may attune your Hearth Kidneystone to any resting location and return to it. 12 hour cooldown, reduced by 5 min every killing blow."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324536] = "Your damaging periodic effects from your spells erupt on all targets, causing 174 Shadowflame damage per effect."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324631] = "Form a shield of flesh and bone over 3 sec that absorbs damage equal to 40% of your maximum health for 2 min.\n\nWhile channeling, your damage taken is reduced by 20%.\n\nPassive: Moving near an enemy's corpse consumes their essence to reduce Fleshcraft's cooldown by 1 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324724] = "An explosion of dark energy infects enemies within 15 yds with Unholy Transfusion, and heals allies for up to 564 based on number of targets.\n\n Unholy Tranfusion\nDeals up to 1,192 Shadow damage based on number of targets over 15 sec. Allies who damage this target are healed for 15."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[324739] = "Call your steward to bring you a Phial of Serenity that can be consumed to restore 20% health and remove all Curse, Disease, Poison, and Bleed effects.\n\nYour Steward additionally offers access to a selection of useful amenities for 4 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325013] = "Draw upon the power of the Ascended for 10 sec, granting you access to Ascended Nova, replacing Smite with Ascended Blast, and increasing movement speed by 50%.\n\nUpon expiration, releases an Ascended Eruption:\n\nExplode for up to 798 Arcane damage to enemies and 610 healing to allies within 15 yds, based on number of targets. Damage and healing increased by 3% for each stack of Boon of the Ascended."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325028] = "Throw a deadly chakram at your current target that will rapidly deal 11 Shadow damage 7 times, bouncing to other targets if they are nearby. Enemies struck by Death Chakram take 10% more Physical damage from you and your pet for 10 sec.\n\nEach time the chakram deals damage, its damage is increased by 15% and you generate 3 Focus."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325037] = "Throw a deadly chakram at your current target that will rapidly deal 11 Shadow damage 7 times, bouncing to other targets if they are nearby. Enemies struck by Death Chakram take 10% more Physical damage from you and your pet for 10 sec.\n\nEach time the chakram deals damage, its damage is increased by 15% and you generate 3 Focus."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325065] = "While out of combat, your Soulshape's teleport becomes a charge, stunning your target for 5 sec and ending your Soulshape."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325066] = "Your damage to targets above 75% health and healing to targets below 35% health is increased by 10%.\n\nWhen your spells and abilities are enhanced this way, you gain 15% increased movement speed for 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325067] = "Soulshape increases the movement speed of allies within 40 yds by 10%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325068] = "When in front of your target, your spells and abilities decrease the damage they inflict on you by 3% for 2 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325069] = "Damaging an enemy before they damage you increases your chance to critical strike by 25% for 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325072] = "Your weapon takes no durability damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325073] = "Your mounted movement speed is increased by 5%. Allies behind you within 40 yds gain this benefit."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325093] = "Reduces the cooldown of Purifying Brew, Celestial Brew, and Celestial Infusion by 20%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325095] = "Touch of Death reduces delayed Stagger damage by 200% of damage dealt."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325153] = "Hurls a flaming keg at the target location, dealing 133 Fire damage to nearby enemies, causing your attacks against them to deal 10 additional Fire damage, and causing their melee attacks to deal 100% reduced damage for the next 3 sec.\n\nResets the cooldown of Keg Smash."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325197] = "Summon an effigy of Chi-Ji for 25 sec that kicks up 3 Gust of Mists when you Blackout Kick, Rising Sun Kick, or Spinning Crane Kick, healing up to 2 allies for 0.\n\nChi-Ji's presence makes you immune to movement impairing effects, makes Enveloping Mist instant cast, and reduces the mana cost of Enveloping Mist by 20%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325201] = "Spending Chi has a chance to make your next Spinning Crane Kick cost no Chi."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325215] = "Touch of Death spawns 3 Chi Spheres, granting 1 Chi when you walk through them."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325216] = "Hurl a brew created from the bones of your enemies at the ground, coating all targets struck for 10 sec.  Your abilities have a 50% chance to affect the target a second time at 40% effectiveness as Shadow damage or healing."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325289] = "Hurl bolts of decimating magic at your target, dealing 522 Shadow damage and increasing the damage of your next 3 Shadow Bolts by 100%.\n\nDecimating Bolt's damage, and the bonus to Shadow Bolt both increase as your target's health decreases."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325330] = "Gain access to Marasmius's mushroom network, allowing you to travel to fae rings throughout Ardenweald."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325554] = "Dark Transformation grants your ghoul 100% energy."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325601] = "After standing still for 5 sec, you take 12% less Physical damage until you move."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325640] = "Wither away all life force of your current target and up to 3 additional targets nearby, causing your primary target to suffer 1,041 Nature damage and secondary targets to suffer 520 Nature damage over 8 sec.\n\nFor the next 8 sec, casting Drain Life will cause you to also Drain Life from any enemy affected by your Soul Rot, and Drain Life will not consume any mana."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325727] = "Command a swarm that heals 670 or deals 638 Shadow damage over 12 sec to a target, and increases the effectiveness of your periodic effects on them by 25%.\n\nUpon expiration, finds a new target, preferring to alternate between friend and foe up to 3 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[325886] = "Unleash a wave of anima, dealing 77 Nature damage to up to 5 enemies and knocking them down for 1.5 sec.\n\nThe ground will continue to expel anima, dealing 49 Nature damage to up to 5 enemies and generating 16 Rage per enemy over 12 sec. Every 3 sec, targets are briefly knocked down."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326059] = "Blast your target with a Primordial Wave, dealing 247 Shadow damage and apply Flame Shock to an enemy, or heal an ally for 249.\n\nYour next Healing Wave will also hit all targets affected by your Riptide for 150% of normal damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326228] = "If you cast Innervate on somebody else, you gain its effect at 50% effectiveness."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326434] = "Form a bond with an ally. Every 1 min, you may empower the bond for 10 sec, granting you an effect based on your partner's role, and granting them an effect based on your role.\n\nDamager\n Kindred Empowerment\nEnergize your bonded partner, granting them 20% of your damage as additional Arcane damage, healing, or absorption."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326504] = "Inflict 57 Shadow damage to your attacker over 5 sec when hit at melee range."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326507] = "Fleshcraft's passive effect reduces the cooldown by an additional 1 sec when it consumes a corpse."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326509] = "Defeating an enemy restores 3% of your maximum health every 6 sec for 6 sec, stacking up to 5 times. Adding stacks refreshes duration."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326511] = "Damaging or healing a target below 35% grants you 35% increased movement speed for 5 sec after you start moving. May only occur once per 1 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326512] = "Mounted movement speed is increased by 5%. If attacked while mounted, mounted movement speed is increased by an additional 10% for 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326513] = "You have a chance to obtain a satchel of a bonesmith's preferred ore and gems when you kill an enemy that yields experience or honor."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326514] = "Your Intellect and Armor are increased by 1% for each enchantment on your armor, up to 3%.\n\nUpon death your armor anchors your soul, allowing you to fight for an additional 10 sec. During this time, your damage and healing done is reduced by 50% and you cannot receive healing. This effect can only occur once every 2 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326572] = "After landing 10 critical strikes, you gain 18% increased chance to critical strike for 10 sec. May only occur once per 60 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326646] = "Duration increased by 4 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326730] = "Hammer of Wrath may be used on any target during Avenging Wrath."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326732] = "Crusader Strike has a 15% chance to make your next Divine Storm free and deal 15% additional damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326734] = "The cooldown of Lay on Hands is reduced up to 60%, based on the target's missing health.\n\nWord of Glory's healing is increased by up to 100% on yourself, based on your missing health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326853] = "Fel Devastation heals for an additional 10%, and 50% of its healing is converted into an absorb shield for 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[326860] = "Opens a mystic portal for 24 sec. Every 3 sec, it summons a spirit of your order's fallen Ox, Crane, or Tiger adepts for 6 sec.\n\nFallen Ox adepts assist for an additional 2 sec, and will also attack your enemies with Breath of Fire."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[327104] = "Strike the ground fiercely to expose a faeline for 30 sec, dealing 13 Nature damage to up to 5 enemies, and restores 352 health to up to 5 allies within 30 yds caught in the faeline. Stagger is 5% more effective for 8 sec against enemies caught in the faeline suffer an additional 22 damage.\n\nYour abilities have a 6% chance of resetting the cooldown of Faeline Stomp while fighting on a faeline."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[327163] = "Blast your target with a Primordial Wave, dealing 249 Shadow damage and apply Flame Shock to an enemy, or heal an ally for 245.\n\nYour next Healing Wave will also hit all targets affected by your Riptide for 150% of normal damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[327541] = "Casting Starfall extends the duration of active Moonfires and Sunfires by 3.0 sec, up to 28 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[327574] = "Sacrifice your ghoul to deal 26 Shadow damage to all nearby enemies and heal for 25% of your maximum health. Deals reduced damage beyond 8 targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[327661] = "Call forth three faerie guardians to attend your targets for 20 sec.\n\nWrathful Faerie: Any direct attacks against the target restore 0.5% Mana or 3 Insanity. Follows your Shadow Word: Pain.\n\nGuardian Faerie: Reduces damage taken by 20%. Follows your Power Word: Shield.\n\nBenevolent Faerie: Increases the cooldown recovery rate of your target's major ability by 100%. Follows your Shadow Mend."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[327977] = "Damage increased 50%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[327980] = "Cooldown reduced by 50%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[327993] = "Barkskin's duration is increased by 4 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328023] = "Moonfire and Sunfire duration increased by 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328025] = "Wild Growth heals 2 additional targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328085] = "Ambush and Mutilate have a 10% chance to make your next Ambush free and usable without Stealth. Chance increased to 20% if the target is under 35% health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328204] = "Throws a hammer at your target dealing 523 Shadow damage, and empowering your next Word of Glory to automatically trigger Light of Dawn with 25% increased effectiveness.\n\nGenerates 1 Holy Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328224] = "Summons Ebon Blade reinforcements to attack your current target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328231] = "Evoke the energy of Wild Spirits at the target location, dealing 8 Nature damage and apply Wild Mark to all enemy targets within the area for 15 sec.\n\nWhile the Wild Spirits are active, each damaging ability you or your pet use against a target in the area will strike up to 5 nearby targets for 13 Nature damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328241] = "You are now able to find and use Dredger Hammers in the Halls of Atonement."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328257] = "Using a spell or ability reduces your magic damage taken by 1% for 6 sec. Using another spell or ability increases this amount by 1% when it is not a repeat of the previous spell or ability, stacking to 3%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328258] = "While above 90% health, your mounted movement speed is increased by 10%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328261] = "Defeating an enemy lowers the cooldown on your Phial of Serenity by 1 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328263] = "You have a chance to obtain cleansed cloth and enchanting materials when you kill an enemy that yields experience or honor."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328265] = "Defeating an enemy reduces the cooldown on your steward's non-Phial services by 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328266] = "Radiant Spark increases your Mastery by 99.3 for 10.0 sec and occasionally expels Sorrowful Memories. \n\nWalking through Sorrowful Memories extends this effect by 3.0 sec. Combat Meditation may only occur once every 1 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328305] = "Infect the target's blood, dealing 63 Nature damage over 10 sec. If the target survives its full duration, they suffer an additional 27 damage and you gain 1 use of any Stealth ability for 5 sec.\n\nCooldown reduced by 30 sec if Sepsis does not last its full duration.\n\nAwards 1 combo point."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328519] = "Call your steward to bring you a Phial of Serenity that can be consumed to restore 20% health and remove all Curse, Disease, Poison, and Bleed effects.\n\nYour Steward additionally offers access to a selection of useful amenities for 4 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328547] = "Embed a bone spike in the target, dealing 46 Physical damage and 3 Bleed damage every 2.7 sec until they die or leave combat. \n\nRefunds a charge when target dies.\n\nAwards 1 combo point plus 1 additional per active bone spike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328620] = "Bless an ally for 30 sec, causing their attacks to have a 40% chance to deal 30% additional damage as Holy.\n\nBlessing of the Seasons: Turns to Autumn after use."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328669] = "Grants an additional charge of Roll and Chi Torpedo."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328670] = "Provoked targets move towards you at 50% increased speed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328725] = "Blade Dance now reduces targets' healing received by 50% for 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328774] = "Your next Curse of Exhaustion, Curse of Tongues or Curse of Weakness cast within 15 sec is amplified.\n\nCurse of Exhaustion\nReduces the target's movement speed by an additional 20%.\n\nCurse of Tongues\nIncreases casting time by an additional 40%.\n\nCurse of Weakness\nEnemy is unable to critically strike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328923] = "Transfer the life force of up to 4 enemies in the targeted area, dealing 2,673 Nature damage evenly split to each enemy target over 2.7 sec. \n\nPressing Fae Transfusion again within 20 sec will release 60% of all damage from Fae Transfusion, healing up to 4 allies within 20 yds."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328928] = "Transfer the life force of up to 4 enemies in the targeted area, dealing 2,659 Nature damage evenly split to each enemy target over 2.7 sec. \n\nPressing Fae Transfusion again within 20 sec will release 60% of all damage from Fae Transfusion, healing up to 4 allies within 20 yds."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[328930] = "Transfer the life force of up to 4 enemies in the targeted area, dealing 2,720 Nature damage evenly split to each enemy target over 2.7 sec. \n\nPressing Fae Transfusion again within 20 sec will release 60% of all damage from Fae Transfusion, healing up to 4 allies within 20 yds."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329033] = "Reduces the cooldown of your Shattering Throw or Wrecking Throw by 50% and increases its damage to absorb shields by an additional 250%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329042] = "Embrace the Emerald Dream, causing you to enter a deep slumber for 8 sec. While sleeping, all other cooldowns recover 400% faster, and allies within 40 yds are healed for 21 every 1 sec.\n\nDirect damage taken may awaken you."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329329] = "The finer points needed to build a dredger. Required for any muckity mucks to oversee dredger building."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329427] = "You have gleaned a rudimentary skill in mirror repair by watching Laurent. Perhaps further reflection can open new doors."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329776] = "Phial of Serenity renders you immune to Curse, Disease, Poison, and Bleed effects for 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329777] = "Phial of Serenity heals you for 35% additional health, but all of its healing is done over 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329778] = "Chance to critical strike is increased by 2% for every nearby enemy or ally, up to 6%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329779] = "Your damaging spells and abilities have a chance to decrease your target's movement speed by 45% for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329781] = "When receiving healing while above 70% health or healing an ally that's above 70% health, 4% of the healing done is repeated on the target over 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329784] = "After 5 sec out of combat, gain a shield for 10% of your maximum health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329786] = "Defeating an enemy grants you 10% movement speed for 20 sec. This effect is increased if defeating a powerful enemy."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[329791] = "Your critical strikes grant you stacks of Valiant Strikes, up to 20. If a nearby party member drops below 50% health, you consume these stacks to heal them for 1% of their maximum health per stack.\n\nAfter healing this way, you may not benefit from Valiant Strikes for 1 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[330046] = "You may now activate Soulguard Braziers to protect yourself and others from negative effects of the Endmire."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331576] = "Door of Shadows disorients all nearby enemies at the target location for 6 sec when you appear."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331577] = "Door of Shadows increases your movement speed by 40%, decaying over 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331579] = "You loot 20% more Infused Rubies, and dredgers throughout Revendreth offer you an expanded selection of goods."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331580] = "The benefits of Well Fed, Flask, and weapon enchant effects are increased by 20%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331582] = "The duration of incoming interrupt, snare, and root effects are reduced by 15%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331584] = "The first enemy you damage in combat is marked as your Adversary. You deal 3% more damage to them, and they deal 1.5% less damage to you. You may only have one Adversary at a time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331586] = "While in combat, you gain a stack of Thrill Seeker every 2 sec, or 4 stacks on killing an enemy. At 40 stacks Thrill Seeker is consumed to grant you Euphoria, increasing your Haste by 20% for 10 sec. Thrill Seeker decays rapidly while you are not in combat."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331609] = "When reduced below 35% health, your Phial of Serenity automatically heals you and consumes a charge."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331610] = "Phial of Serenity also knocks nearby enemies away from you."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331611] = "After 5 sec standing still, incoming stun and incapacitate durations are reduced by 15%. Lasts for 5 sec once you start moving."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331612] = "When reduced below 30% health, you stun nearby enemies for 3 sec. This effect may only occur once every 60 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331725] = "Fall damage decreased by 20%, and after taking fall damage, damage you take is reduced by 20% for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[331726] = "Casting or receiving healing has a chance to improve the remaining durability on your armor."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[332753] = "Successfully interrupting an enemy or dispelling an ally increases your critical strike chance by 10% for 10 sec. This may only occur once every 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[332754] = "Standing still for at least 4 sec grants you 10% increased Stamina, and 4% increased healing done. This effect persists for 6 sec after you start moving."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[332755] = "Your equipment takes 50% less durability damage from death."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[332756] = "Leaving a resting area increases your mounted speed by 10%, and your out of combat regeneration by 100%. Lasts 10 min, and completing a World Quest refreshes the duration."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[333163] = "Lowers the Decadence level of your court."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[333265] = "Adds the Deep Echo Trident blueprint to Dactylis's library, allowing you to craft it through Ascension Crafting."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[333266] = "Adds the Charm of Fortitude blueprint to Dactylis's library, allowing you to craft it through Ascension Crafting."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[333322] = "Raises the Excitement level of your court."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[333889] = "Your next Imp, Voidwalker, Incubus, Succubus, Felhunter, or Felguard Summon spell is free and has its casting time reduced by 90%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[333919] = "Lava Burst has an additional charge."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[333935] = "Damaging a new enemy grants you 3% Haste for 10 sec, up to 5 stacks."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[333950] = "After using 75 damaging or healing spells and abilities, your next spell or ability summons Bron, who knocks enemies back on arrival and then attacks and heals your targets for 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[333974] = "Erupt a burst of fiery damage from all targets affected by your Flame Shock, dealing 34 Volcanic damage to up to 6 targets within 8 yds of your Flame Shock targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334033] = "Lava Lash cooldown reduced by 6.0 sec, and if Lava Lash is used against a target affected by your Flame Shock, Flame Shock will be spread to up to 5 nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334046] = "Lava Lash and Sundering increases the damage of Flame Shock on its target by 100% for 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334066] = "While above 90% health, you increase nearby party members' maximum health by 5%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334195] = "Each stack of Maelstrom Weapon consumed increases the damage of your next Frost Shock by 15%, and causes it to hit 1 additional target, up to 5 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334275] = "Reduces the target's movement speed by 50% for 12 sec.\n\nCurses: A warlock can only have one Curse active per target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334308] = "Chain Lightning now jumps to 2 additional targets and deals 10% increased damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334319] = "Damaging an enemy with Agony increases the damage dealt by your next Drain Life by 7%. This effect stacks up to 50 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334585] = "Summoning your Demonic Tyrant instantly generates 3 Soul Shards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334591] = "Teaches your Wild Imps how to spend 20% less energy when casting Fel Firebolt."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334745] = "Completing quests, opening treasures, and defeating rare enemies in the Maw will now incur the Eye of the Jailer, who will torment you with punishments of increasing deadliness."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334746] = "Unlock access to Torghast, Tower of the Damned."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334779] = "When an ability used during Sweeping Strikes damages a second target, your next Cleave or Whirlwind deals 25% increased damage, stacking up to 3 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[334993] = "The cooldown of Die by the Sword is reduced by 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335010] = "6.0% of damage you deal adds to your active Ignore Pain."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335034] = "Rallying Cry's duration and health granted are increased by 20%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335077] = "Rampage increases your haste by 2% for 12 sec. Multiple instances of this effect may overlap."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335196] = "Intervene reduces damage taken by the target by 10%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335232] = "Execute increases the critical strike chance of Execute by 0.0% for 8 sec, stacking up to 8 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335242] = "Overpower deals 8.0% increased damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335250] = "Intimidating Shout can withstand 80% more damage before breaking."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335254] = "The Countess will now deign to consider your RSVP requests."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335260] = "When Bladestorm ends, Whirlwind deals 0% increased damage for 9 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335467] = "A word of madness haunts the target's mind, dealing 864 Shadow damage instantly plus an additional 2,905 Shadow damage over 6 sec. Heals you for 30% of damage dealt.\n\nWhen reapplied to a target, all remaining damage is added to the new effect."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335591] = "Adds the Charm of Alacrity blueprint to Dactylis's library, allowing you to craft it through Ascension Crafting."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335605] = "Adds the Charm of Persistence blueprint to Dactylis's library, allowing you to craft it through Ascension Crafting."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335684] = "Opens a mystic portal for 24 sec. Every 3 sec, it summons a spirit of your order's fallen Ox, Crane, or Tiger adepts for 6 sec.\n\nFallen Ox adepts assist for an additional 2 sec, and will also attack your enemies with Breath of Fire."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335696] = "Adds the Kyrian Smith's Kit blueprint to Dactylis's library, allowing you to craft it through Ascension Crafting."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335870] = "Raises the Formality level of your court."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335931] = "Brandish the Conqueror's Banner, granting 346 Mastery and 30% increased movement speed to you and your 2 nearest allies, and preventing movement speed from being reduced below 100%. Lasts 15 sec.\n\nGenerates 4 Rage per sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335932] = "Throw a deadly chakram at your current target that will rapidly deal 11 Shadow damage 7 times, bouncing to other targets if they are nearby. Enemies struck by Death Chakram take 10% more Physical damage from you and your pet for 10 sec.\n\nEach time the chakram deals damage, its damage is increased by 15% and you generate 3 Focus."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335933] = "Sprout an additional limb, dealing 129 Shadow damage over 12 sec to all nearby enemies. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets. Every 1 sec, an enemy is pulled to your location if they are further than 8 yds from you. The same enemy can only be pulled once every 4 sec.\n\nGain  instantly, and again every 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335934] = "Your damaging abilities have a chance to call forth a demon from the Theater of Pain for 25 sec. Throw Glaive deals lethal damage to the demon, which explodes on death, dealing 67 Shadow damage to nearby enemies and healing you for 20% of your maximum health. The explosion deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335935] = "Command a swarm that heals 670 or deals 638 Shadow damage over 12 sec to a target, and increases the effectiveness of your periodic effects on them by 25%.\n\nUpon expiration, finds a new target, preferring to alternate between friend and foe up to 3 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335936] = "Transform into a powerful skeletal mage for 25 sec. \n\nWhile in the form of a skeletal mage, your Frostbolt, Fireball, and Arcane Blast hit up to 2 enemies near your target and your spell damage is increased by 15%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335937] = "Hurl a brew created from the bones of your enemies at the ground, coating all targets struck for 10 sec.  Your abilities have a 50% chance to affect the target a second time at 40% effectiveness as Shadow damage or healing."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335939] = "Throws a hammer at your target dealing 505 Shadow damage, and empowering your next Word of Glory to automatically trigger Light of Dawn with 25% increased effectiveness.\n\nGenerates 1 Holy Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335940] = "Embed a bone spike in the target, dealing 45 Physical damage and 3 Bleed damage every 2.7 sec until they die or leave combat. \n\nRefunds a charge when target dies.\n\nAwards 1 combo point plus 1 additional per active bone spike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335941] = "Blast your target with a Primordial Wave, dealing 243 Shadow damage and apply Flame Shock to an enemy, or heal an ally for 244.\n\nYour next Healing Wave will also hit all targets affected by your Riptide for 150% of normal damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[335942] = "Hurl bolts of decimating magic at your target, dealing 531 Shadow damage and increasing the damage of your next 3 Shadow Bolts by 100%.\n\nDecimating Bolt's damage, and the bonus to Shadow Bolt both increase as your target's health decreases."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336140] = "Door of Shadows frees you from roots and snares."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336147] = "Door of Shadows has 2 charges, but its cooldown is increased by 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336184] = "You have a chance to obtain an assortment of flavorful herbs and beverages when you kill an enemy that yields experience or honor."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336191] = "Victory Rush heals you for 200% of the damage it dealt over 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336239] = "Your spells and abilities have a chance to call Tubbins and Gubbins to your side for 12 sec, parasol in hand. Standing in the shaded area grants you 138 Mastery."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336243] = "The effects of combat potions last 100% to 200% longer."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336245] = "Grant a shield that absorbs 570 damage to allies who aid you with healing or beneficial magic effects. You will only shield each ally once every 20 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336247] = "During the Ember Court, your Guests gain additional Happiness for each event completed. When the Court concludes, the effects of any Decrees bestowed upon you are increased."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336268] = "Lowers the Danger level of your court."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336379] = "Expel Harm's healing is increased by 20.0%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336452] = "Fists of Fury's damage is increased by 20.0%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336460] = "Frozen Orb's damage is increased by 10.0%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336472] = "Blizzard's damage is increased by 5.0%, and its movement speed reduction is increased by 10%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336502] = "Lowers the Excitement level of your court."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336512] = "Raises the Cleanliness level of your court."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336522] = "While Icy Veins is active, your critical hits reduce its cooldown by 0.00 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336526] = "Spinning Crane Kick's bonus from striking a unique target with Tiger Palm, Blackout Kick, or Rising Sun Kick is increased by an additional 10.0%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336569] = "Increases the damage of Ice Lance against frozen enemies by 4.0%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336598] = "After your Storm, Earth, and Fire spirits fixate on the same target, they deal 10.0% increased damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336613] = "The cooldown of Ice Block is reduced by 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336616] = "Abilities that activate Combo Strikes reduce the cooldown of Invoke Xuen, the White Tiger by 0.1 sec, and Xuen's damage is increased by 10.0%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336632] = "When casting Vivify on yourself, its healing is increased by 10.0%, and it has a 30% chance to refund its cost."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336636] = "The cooldown of Blink is reduced by 1.0 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336639] = "Immolation Aura damage increases the duration of your Fiery Brand and Sigil of Flame by 0.25 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336655] = "Unlocks Mad Mortimer as an opponent in the Path of Ascension."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336675] = "Unlocks Athanos as an opponent in the Path of Ascension."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336693] = "Turn into a Vulpin, teleporting 15 yds forward and increasing your movement speed by 50%. You may reactivate Soulshape every few sec to teleport again.\n\nLasts 12 sec, or indefinitely while in a rest area."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336773] = "Abilities that activate Gust of Mist reduce the cooldown on Invoke Yul'on, the Jade Serpent by 0.3 sec, and Yu'lon's Soothing Breath healing is increased by 10.0%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336777] = "Successfully interrupting an enemy with Counterspell reduces its cooldown by 1.0 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336812] = "Gust of Mists has a 30% chance to do 25.0% more healing."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336821] = "While Combustion is active, your Fire Blast grants you 3.0%  increased Fire damage for 5 sec, stacking up to 2 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336852] = "Flamestrike's damage is increased by 8.0%, and its radius is increased by 10%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336853] = "Fortifying Brew grants you a shield equal to 5.0% of your maximum health for 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336873] = "Each wave of a Clearcast Arcane Missiles reduces the cooldown of Arcane Power by 0.00 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336884] = "When Paralysis ends, your target's movement speed is reduced by 6.0% for 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336886] = "Consuming Clearcasting increases the damage of your next 2 Arcane Blasts by 0%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336890] = "Targets affected by your Leg Sweep deal -0.0% less damage for 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336992] = "Shifting Power reduces your Mage ability cooldowns by an additional 4.0 sec over 3.6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[336999] = "Deathborne's duration is increased by 3.0 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337043] = "A heavy mist surrounds you for 8 sec, increasing your Dodge by 10%. \n\nDeals 7 Shadow damage every 1 sec to enemies within 10 yds. Every time it deals damage you gain 3 Runic Power, up to a maximum of 15 Runic Power. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337044] = "Brand an enemy with the mark of the Venthyr, reducing their melee attack speed by 30%, their casting speed by 30%, and inflicting 132 Shadow damage over 8 sec.\n\nActivating Metamorphosis applies Sinful Brand to all nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337045] = "For 20 sec, Druid spells you cast increase your damage and healing by 2%, and haste by 1%, stacking.\n\nIf you spend 2 sec idle, the Frenzy overcomes you, consuming 1% of your health per stack, stunning you for 1 sec, and ending."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337046] = "Fire a shot at your enemy, dealing 17 Shadow damage and then causing them to bleed for 44 Shadow damage over 18 sec. Each time Flayed Shot deals damage, you have a 15% chance to gain Flayer's Mark, causing your next Kill Shot to be free, usable on any target regardless of their current health, and deal 25% increased damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337048] = "Conjure 3 mirrors to torment the enemy for 25 sec. Whenever the target attacks, casts a spell, or uses an ability, a mirror is consumed to inflict 252 Shadow damage and their movement and cast speed are slowed by 15%. This effect cannot be triggered more often than once per 6 sec.\n\nThe final mirror will instead inflict 631 Shadow damage to the enemy, Rooting and Silencing them for 4 sec.\n\nWhenever a mirror is consumed you gain Clearcasting."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337050] = "Hallow the target area for 30 sec. Enemies in the area suffer up to 3,547 Shadow damage, and allies are healed for up to 2,340, reduced if there are more than 5 targets.\n\nWithin the Hallow, you may use Hammer of Wrath on any target, and its damage is increased by 100%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337051] = "Assault an enemy's mind, dealing 1,125 Shadow damage and briefly reversing their perception of reality.\n\nFor 5 sec, the next 1,710 damage they deal will heal their target, and the next 1,710 healing they deal will damage their target.\n\nReversed damage and healing restore up to 4% mana."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337052] = "Lash the target for 17 Shadow damage, causing each combo point spent within 12 sec to lash for an additional 3. Dealing damage with Flagellation increases your Haste by 1%, persisting 12 sec after their torment fades."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337054] = "Send a wave of anima at the target, which then jumps to additional nearby targets. Deals 788 Shadow damage to up to 5 enemies, and restores 1,217 health to up to 5 allies.\n\nFor each target critically struck, the cooldown of Chain Harvest is reduced by 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337055] = "Call forth a cloud of chaotic anima that travels to the target enemy, dealing 94 Shadow damage to enemies in its path. When the anima reaches the target it explodes, inflicting either Curse of Weakness or Curse of Tongues, and dealing 674 Shadow damage over 12 sec to all nearby enemies."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337056] = "Learn Condemn, replacing Execute. Condemn deals Shadow damage, can be used on enemies who are above 80% health or below 20% health, and weakens the target preventing some of the damage they would deal to you."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337058] = "Radiant Spark increases the damage your spells deal to the target by an additional 2.0%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337069] = "An explosion of dark energy infects enemies within 15 yds with Unholy Transfusion, and heals allies for up to 579 based on number of targets.\n\n Unholy Tranfusion\nDeals up to 1,192 Shadow damage based on number of targets over 15 sec. Allies who damage this target are healed for 15."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337078] = "Transcendence: Transfer increases your movement speed by 10.0% for 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337084] = "Blackout Kick has a 0.0% chance to grant a charge of Roll."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337087] = "Each time a Mirror of Torment is consumed your spell damage is increased by 1.0% for 10 sec, stacking 3 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337099] = "Rising Sun Kick reduces the remaining cooldown on Revival by 1.0 sec, and Revival heals targets for 10.0% of Revival's heal over 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337119] = "Keg Smash deals an additional 20.0% damage to targets affected by Breath of Fire."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337123] = "While inside Ice Block, you heal for 20% of your maximum health over the duration."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337133] = "Unlocks Echthra as an opponent in the Path of Ascension."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337134] = "While under the effects of Celestial Brew, your effects that heal you are increased by 20.0%."
