WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337381] = "Dark Transformation's duration is increased by 3 sec and your Minion damage is increased by 6.0%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337430] = "Corrupts the targeted ground, causing 21 Shadow damage over 10 sec to targets within the area.\n\nDeath's Due reduces damage enemies deal to you by 2%, up to a maximum of 8% and their power is transferred to you as an equal amount of Strength."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337431] = "Charge to your target, striking them for 159 Nature damage, rooting them in place for 1.5 sec and inflicting 115 Nature damage over 6 sec to up to 5 enemies in your path. \n\nThe pursuit invigorates your soul, healing you for 25% of the damage you deal to your Hunt target for 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337433] = "Call upon the Night Fae for an eruption of energy, channeling a rapid flurry of 16 Druid spells and abilities over 4 sec.\n\nYou will cast Wild Growth, Swiftmend, Moonfire, Wrath, Regrowth, Rejuvenation, Rake, and Thrash on appropriate nearby targets, favoring your current shapeshift form."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337434] = "Evoke the energy of Wild Spirits at the target location, dealing 8 Nature damage and apply Wild Mark to all enemy targets within the area for 15 sec.\n\nWhile the Wild Spirits are active, each damaging ability you or your pet use against a target in the area will strike up to 5 nearby targets for 13 Nature damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337435] = "Draw power from the ground beneath, dealing 1,043 Nature damage over 3.6 sec to enemies within 18 yds. \n\nWhile channeling, your Mage ability cooldowns are reduced by 10 sec over 3.6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337436] = "Strike the ground fiercely to expose a faeline for 30 sec, dealing 14 Nature damage to up to 5 enemies, and restores 350 health to up to 5 allies within 30 yds caught in the faeline. Stagger is 5% more effective for 8 sec against enemies caught in the faeline suffer an additional 22 damage.\n\nYour abilities have a 6% chance of resetting the cooldown of Faeline Stomp while fighting on a faeline."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337438] = "Bless an ally for 30 sec, causing their attacks to have a 40% chance to deal 30% additional damage as Holy.\n\nBlessing of the Seasons: Turns to Autumn after use."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337439] = "Call forth three faerie guardians to attend your targets for 20 sec.\n\nWrathful Faerie: Any direct attacks against the target restore 0.5% Mana or 3 Insanity. Follows your Shadow Word: Pain.\n\nGuardian Faerie: Reduces damage taken by 20%. Follows your Power Word: Shield.\n\nBenevolent Faerie: Increases the cooldown recovery rate of your target's major ability by 100%. Follows your Shadow Mend."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337440] = "Infect the target's blood, dealing 63 Nature damage over 10 sec. If the target survives its full duration, they suffer an additional 27 damage and you gain 1 use of any Stealth ability for 5 sec.\n\nCooldown reduced by 30 sec if Sepsis does not last its full duration.\n\nAwards 1 combo point."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337441] = "Transfer the life force of up to 4 enemies in the targeted area, dealing 2,643 Nature damage evenly split to each enemy target over 2.7 sec. \n\nPressing Fae Transfusion again within 20 sec will release 60% of all damage from Fae Transfusion, healing up to 4 allies within 20 yds."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337444] = "Wither away all life force of your current target and up to 3 additional targets nearby, causing your primary target to suffer 1,041 Nature damage and secondary targets to suffer 520 Nature damage over 8 sec.\n\nFor the next 8 sec, casting Drain Life will cause you to also Drain Life from any enemy affected by your Soul Rot, and Drain Life will not consume any mana."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[337446] = "Unleash a wave of anima, dealing 77 Nature damage to up to 5 enemies and knocking them down for 1.5 sec.\n\nThe ground will continue to expel anima, dealing 49 Nature damage to up to 5 enemies and generating 16 Rage per enemy over 12 sec. Every 3 sec, targets are briefly knocked down."
