WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[381655] = "Increases the critical strike chance of your Nature spells and abilities by 2%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Spell[381664] = "Coats your weapons with a Lethal Poison that lasts for 1 hour. Each strike has a 30% chance to poison the enemy, dealing 2 Nature damage and applying Amplifying Poison for 12 sec. Envenom can consume 10 stacks of Amplifying Poison to deal 35% increased damage. Max 20 stacks."
